<head><meta charset="utf-8"><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml><x:ExcelWorkbook><x:ExcelWorksheets><x:ExcelWorksheet>
<x:Name>分镜表</x:Name></x:ExcelWorksheet></x:ExcelWorksheets></x:ExcelWorkbook></xml><![endif]--></head>
<body><table border="1"><thead><tr><th>镜头序号</th><th>镜号</th><th>镜头标题</th><th>段幕</th><th>时长(秒)</th><th>景别</th><th>运镜</th><th>场景</th><th>角色</th><th>道具</th><th>地点</th><th>时间</th><th>镜头描述</th><th>对白</th><th>解说旁白</th><th>动作</th><th>结果</th><th>氛围</th><th>布局描述</th><th>首帧提示词</th><th>尾帧提示词</th><th>图片提示词</th><th>视频提示词</th><th>全能片段</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">1</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">1</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">司仪递话筒</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第1幕·婚礼质问</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">6</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">中景</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">推镜</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅&#10;时间：午·内&#10;提示词：空无一人的酒店婚宴厅内部，午间自然光与宴会厅暖色灯光交织，二十桌圆形宴席整齐摆放，白色桌布、香槟色椅套、中央花艺、红金色婚礼布置，前方小型舞台和麦克风架，红色地毯通道，水晶吊灯，墙壁装饰喜字与纱幔，地面光洁反射灯光，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯场景背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内场景&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅，层高约六米，米金色软包墙面配红金婚礼布置；主材为抛光大理石地面、白色亚麻桌布、香槟色弹力椅套、水晶吊灯、纱幔与绒面地毯；二十桌圆形宴席分列中轴通道两侧，尽端为小型舞台与麦克风架，墙面悬挂喜字&#10;默认光线: 午间自然光由左侧落地窗斜入，与宴会厅暖色灯光（色温约3000K）交织，地面光洁形成大面积倒影与光斑&#10;气氛基调: 暖金与正红交织的喜庆色调，明亮通透，庄重而有仪式感&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;机位位于宴会厅后部入口处，视高约1.6米，地面平视广角镜头，横构图纳入整个大厅全貌：近景为最后排圆桌的白色桌布与香槟色椅背，中景为二十桌宴席沿中轴红色地毯通道对称纵深排开，远景为尽端小型舞台、麦克风架与喜字纱幔背景板。顶部成排水晶吊灯自前景延伸至舞台，左侧落地窗漏入的午间自然光在大理石地面拉出长条光带，与暖黄灯光在桌布上重叠。天花灯槽与墙面米金软包构成完整空间边界，整体色调暖金偏红，纵深感强烈。&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;机位移至中轴通道中段偏右，视高约1.4米，中景视角对准舞台前区与主通道交汇处——即迎宾与仪式展开的核心地带。红色地毯通道笔直通向舞台三级台阶，舞台台面深色木地板微微反光，中央矗立银色麦克风架，两侧摆放高身花艺与红金纱幔立柱。通道两侧最近的两桌圆宴清晰可见：白色桌布垂坠至地，香槟色椅套包裹椅背并系有金色蝴蝶结，桌面中央花艺、编号立牌与酒杯按位次排布。午间自然光斜落在舞台前沿与地毯上，与吊灯暖光在桌面形成冷暖交界的柔和光斑，地面倒影清晰。&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;特写镜头，机位贴近一桌宴席桌沿，视高约0.9米，浅景深虚化背景成排桌椅。画面主体为桌面陈设的材质与色彩层次：白色亚麻桌布细致织纹与自然垂褶，香槟色椅套的弹力布面与缎带光泽，中央花艺以白玫瑰、香槟玫瑰与红色果实相间插制，配暗金铜质花瓶；旁侧摆放高脚杯、骨质瓷餐具与红色喜糖盒，边缘露出红金桌卡与喜字纹样。侧逆的午间自然光在玻璃杯壁与银器上留下细亮高光，暖光则填亮花瓣暗部，质感细腻、明暗过渡柔和，集中呈现婚宴的正式与喜庆细节。&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位改为宴会厅左前侧二层回廊边缘，视高约3.2米，微俯斜角向下俯瞰全厅，与第1格机位高度和方向明确区别。画面呈对角线构图：近景为回廊栏杆与两侧墙面的喜字纱幔，中景为成排圆桌构成的白色弧形阵列与穿插其间的红色地毯通道，远景为舞台与背景板完整侧脸。顶部水晶吊灯由近及远层层排开，暖黄光点在地面大理石上连成倒影光带，左侧落地窗的午间自然光斜切整个大厅，勾出桌布与椅背的立体边缘。空间纵深、层高比例与建筑结构关系一目了然，光线、时段与天气与前三格完全一致。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新娘，也是周维的未婚妻。婚宴上她当众追问母亲住处，揭穿三十万借款和担保问题，最终摘下戒指宣布不结婚。她冷静独立，对母亲的偏袒感到痛苦，仍试图带母亲离开。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).&#10;&#10;周维&#10;外貌：男性，年龄约三十岁上下，身高约一米八，体型匀称偏壮，肩背宽厚。方脸，颧骨略高，浓眉，内双，眼神精明而带压迫感，鼻梁挺直，嘴唇偏厚，下颌线硬朗。黑色短发，鬓角修短，皮肤偏小麦色，下巴有细微胡茬。身穿深色西装，白衬衫，系深色领带，西装剪裁合体，袖口平整，手指粗壮，戴一枚男士婚戒。整体气质强势现实。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新郎，沈念的未婚夫。他向林秀兰借款三十万并转给妹妹，隐瞒担保，婚宴上公开旧担保复印件逼迫沈念。他强势现实，仍要搬空老房，是冲突的核心人物。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;男性，年龄约三十岁上下，身高约一米八，体型匀称偏壮，肩背宽厚。方脸，颧骨略高，浓眉，内双，眼神精明而带压迫感，鼻梁挺直，嘴唇偏厚，下颌线硬朗。黑色短发，鬓角修短，皮肤偏小麦色，下巴有细微胡茬。身穿深色西装，白衬衫，系深色领带，西装剪裁合体，袖口平整，手指粗壮，戴一枚男士婚戒。整体气质强势现实。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: male only — masculine build and facial features; do not feminize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).&#10;&#10;林秀兰&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约五十六七岁，体型偏瘦，背略佝偻。圆脸，颧骨微凸，眼角与嘴角有细纹，眉色浅淡，眼神疲惫躲闪，鼻翼较宽，嘴唇干薄。头发花白掺杂，短卷发梳理整齐，皮肤暗黄，有老年斑和真实皮肤纹理。身穿暗紫红色针织开衫，内搭深色衬衫，下穿黑色长裤，手拿旧式手袋，手指关节明显。整体气质操劳隐忍。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：沈念的母亲。她卖掉老房支持女儿婚房，借款给周维并签协议，婚礼上试图维持局面，最后把老房钥匙交给周维。她偏袒周维，与女儿关系紧张。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约五十六七岁，体型偏瘦，背略佝偻。圆脸，颧骨微凸，眼角与嘴角有细纹，眉色浅淡，眼神疲惫躲闪，鼻翼较宽，嘴唇干薄。头发花白掺杂，短卷发梳理整齐，皮肤暗黄，有老年斑和真实皮肤纹理。身穿暗紫红色针织开衫，内搭深色衬衫，下穿黑色长裤，手拿旧式手袋，手指关节明显。整体气质操劳隐忍。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).&#10;&#10;司仪&#10;外貌：成年婚礼主持人，深色正装，手持话筒；制作设计待导演确定。&#10;描述：婚礼主持人，只负责开场询问。Agent制作设计，原文未指定外貌。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台，二十桌宾客分列两侧，红毯从舞台延伸至入口，舞台背景为粉色花艺拱门</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午间，婚宴厅内暖黄灯光，水晶吊灯投下密集光斑</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】中景&#10;【运镜】推镜&#10;【动作】司仪站在舞台中央，将话筒递给沈念，镜头从司仪肩后缓推向沈念正面。沈念接过话筒但目光没有看周维，而是越过二十桌宾客，缓缓落在母亲林秀兰身上。&#10;【对话】司仪：&quot;请新娘说一句，你愿不愿意。&quot;&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】沈念手握话筒，目光锁定远处母亲，嘴唇微启，全场安静等待。&#10;【情绪】紧张</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">司仪：&quot;请新娘说一句，你愿不愿意。&quot;</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">司仪站在舞台中央，将话筒递给沈念，镜头从司仪肩后缓推向沈念正面。沈念接过话筒但目光没有看周维，而是越过二十桌宾客，缓缓落在母亲林秀兰身上。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念手握话筒，目光锁定远处母亲，嘴唇微启，全场安静等待。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">暖黄主光从顶部打亮舞台，宾客席间散落冷白补光，空气中浮动着午宴的油烟与花香，氛围表面喜庆却暗藏紧绷</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台，二十桌宾客分列两侧，红毯从舞台延伸至入口，舞台背景为红金花艺拱门，午间，婚宴厅内暖黄灯光，水晶吊灯投下密集光斑，中景·平视·正面，司仪站在舞台中央，将话筒递给沈念，镜头从司仪肩后缓推向沈念正面。沈念接过话筒但目光没有看周维，而是越过二十桌宾客，缓缓落在母亲林秀兰身上，紧张，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo，首帧静止画面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">场景：婚宴厅主舞台，二十桌宾客分列两侧，红毯从舞台延伸至入口，舞台背景为红金花艺拱门，午间，婚宴厅内暖黄灯光，水晶吊灯投下密集光斑。镜头标题：司仪递话筒。动作：司仪站在舞台中央，将话筒递给沈念，镜头从司仪肩后缓推向沈念正面。沈念接过话筒但目光没有看周维，而是越过二十桌宾客，缓缓落在母亲林秀兰身上。。对话：司仪：&quot;请新娘说一句，你愿不愿意。&quot;。结果：沈念手握话筒，目光锁定远处母亲，嘴唇微启，全场安静等待。。景别：中景。镜头角度：中景·平视·正面（medium shot (waist-up to full body), character and immediate surroundings visible, moderate depth of field, eye-level shot, neutral perspective, natural horizontal framing, shooting from the front）。运镜：推镜。氛围：暖黄主光从顶部打亮舞台，宾客席间散落冷白补光，空气中浮动着午宴的油烟与花香，氛围表面喜庆却暗藏紧绷。情绪：紧张。音效：宴会厅嘈杂人声渐弱，话筒轻微电流声，司仪声音爽朗热情。时长：6秒。风格：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo。=VideoRatio: 16:9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">2</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">2</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念问母</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第1幕·婚礼质问</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">5</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">近景</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">推镜</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅&#10;时间：午·内&#10;提示词：空无一人的酒店婚宴厅内部，午间自然光与宴会厅暖色灯光交织，二十桌圆形宴席整齐摆放，白色桌布、香槟色椅套、中央花艺、红金色婚礼布置，前方小型舞台和麦克风架，红色地毯通道，水晶吊灯，墙壁装饰喜字与纱幔，地面光洁反射灯光，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯场景背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内场景&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅，层高约六米，米金色软包墙面配红金婚礼布置；主材为抛光大理石地面、白色亚麻桌布、香槟色弹力椅套、水晶吊灯、纱幔与绒面地毯；二十桌圆形宴席分列中轴通道两侧，尽端为小型舞台与麦克风架，墙面悬挂喜字&#10;默认光线: 午间自然光由左侧落地窗斜入，与宴会厅暖色灯光（色温约3000K）交织，地面光洁形成大面积倒影与光斑&#10;气氛基调: 暖金与正红交织的喜庆色调，明亮通透，庄重而有仪式感&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;机位位于宴会厅后部入口处，视高约1.6米，地面平视广角镜头，横构图纳入整个大厅全貌：近景为最后排圆桌的白色桌布与香槟色椅背，中景为二十桌宴席沿中轴红色地毯通道对称纵深排开，远景为尽端小型舞台、麦克风架与喜字纱幔背景板。顶部成排水晶吊灯自前景延伸至舞台，左侧落地窗漏入的午间自然光在大理石地面拉出长条光带，与暖黄灯光在桌布上重叠。天花灯槽与墙面米金软包构成完整空间边界，整体色调暖金偏红，纵深感强烈。&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;机位移至中轴通道中段偏右，视高约1.4米，中景视角对准舞台前区与主通道交汇处——即迎宾与仪式展开的核心地带。红色地毯通道笔直通向舞台三级台阶，舞台台面深色木地板微微反光，中央矗立银色麦克风架，两侧摆放高身花艺与红金纱幔立柱。通道两侧最近的两桌圆宴清晰可见：白色桌布垂坠至地，香槟色椅套包裹椅背并系有金色蝴蝶结，桌面中央花艺、编号立牌与酒杯按位次排布。午间自然光斜落在舞台前沿与地毯上，与吊灯暖光在桌面形成冷暖交界的柔和光斑，地面倒影清晰。&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;特写镜头，机位贴近一桌宴席桌沿，视高约0.9米，浅景深虚化背景成排桌椅。画面主体为桌面陈设的材质与色彩层次：白色亚麻桌布细致织纹与自然垂褶，香槟色椅套的弹力布面与缎带光泽，中央花艺以白玫瑰、香槟玫瑰与红色果实相间插制，配暗金铜质花瓶；旁侧摆放高脚杯、骨质瓷餐具与红色喜糖盒，边缘露出红金桌卡与喜字纹样。侧逆的午间自然光在玻璃杯壁与银器上留下细亮高光，暖光则填亮花瓣暗部，质感细腻、明暗过渡柔和，集中呈现婚宴的正式与喜庆细节。&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位改为宴会厅左前侧二层回廊边缘，视高约3.2米，微俯斜角向下俯瞰全厅，与第1格机位高度和方向明确区别。画面呈对角线构图：近景为回廊栏杆与两侧墙面的喜字纱幔，中景为成排圆桌构成的白色弧形阵列与穿插其间的红色地毯通道，远景为舞台与背景板完整侧脸。顶部水晶吊灯由近及远层层排开，暖黄光点在地面大理石上连成倒影光带，左侧落地窗的午间自然光斜切整个大厅，勾出桌布与椅背的立体边缘。空间纵深、层高比例与建筑结构关系一目了然，光线、时段与天气与前三格完全一致。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新娘，也是周维的未婚妻。婚宴上她当众追问母亲住处，揭穿三十万借款和担保问题，最终摘下戒指宣布不结婚。她冷静独立，对母亲的偏袒感到痛苦，仍试图带母亲离开。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台，沈念站在话筒架前，身后是周维模糊的身影</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午间，婚宴厅内暖黄灯光，侧光勾勒沈念面部轮廓</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】近景&#10;【运镜】推镜&#10;【动作】沈念紧握话筒，目光越过镜头方向望向远处，眼眶微红但语气克制。镜头从近景缓推至特写，背景宾客虚化成暖色光斑。&#10;【对话】沈念：&quot;妈，房子卖了，你住哪？&quot;&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】沈念问完，嘴唇抿紧，话筒因手部细微颤抖而轻微晃动。&#10;【情绪】隐忍</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念：&quot;妈，房子卖了，你住哪？&quot;</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念紧握话筒，目光越过镜头方向望向远处，眼眶微红但语气克制。镜头从近景缓推至特写，背景宾客虚化成暖色光斑。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念问完，嘴唇抿紧，话筒因手部细微颤抖而轻微晃动。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">暖黄侧光从右侧打来，左脸落入柔和阴影，背景虚化光斑如散落的烛火，氛围由喜庆转向凝重</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台，沈念站在话筒架前，身后是周维模糊的身影，午间，婚宴厅内暖黄灯光，侧光勾勒沈念面部轮廓，特写·平视·正面，沈念紧握话筒，目光越过镜头方向望向远处，眼眶微红但语气克制。镜头从近景缓推至特写，背景宾客虚化成暖色光斑，隐忍，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo，首帧静止画面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">场景：婚宴厅主舞台，沈念站在话筒架前，身后是周维模糊的身影，午间，婚宴厅内暖黄灯光，侧光勾勒沈念面部轮廓。镜头标题：沈念问母。动作：沈念紧握话筒，目光越过镜头方向望向远处，眼眶微红但语气克制。镜头从近景缓推至特写，背景宾客虚化成暖色光斑。。对话：沈念：&quot;妈，房子卖了，你住哪？&quot;。结果：沈念问完，嘴唇抿紧，话筒因手部细微颤抖而轻微晃动。。景别：近景。镜头角度：特写·平视·正面（close-up shot (face/bust framing), subject fills most of frame, shallow depth of field, background softly blurred, eye-level shot, neutral perspective, natural horizontal framing, shooting from the front）。运镜：推镜。氛围：暖黄侧光从右侧打来，左脸落入柔和阴影，背景虚化光斑如散落的烛火，氛围由喜庆转向凝重。情绪：隐忍。音效：话筒轻微摩擦声，沈念声音略带颤抖但清晰有力。时长：5秒。风格：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo。=VideoRatio: 16:9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">3</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">3</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维抢话</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第1幕·婚礼质问</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">6</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">中景</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">横摇</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅&#10;时间：午·内&#10;提示词：空无一人的酒店婚宴厅内部，午间自然光与宴会厅暖色灯光交织，二十桌圆形宴席整齐摆放，白色桌布、香槟色椅套、中央花艺、红金色婚礼布置，前方小型舞台和麦克风架，红色地毯通道，水晶吊灯，墙壁装饰喜字与纱幔，地面光洁反射灯光，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯场景背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内场景&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅，层高约六米，米金色软包墙面配红金婚礼布置；主材为抛光大理石地面、白色亚麻桌布、香槟色弹力椅套、水晶吊灯、纱幔与绒面地毯；二十桌圆形宴席分列中轴通道两侧，尽端为小型舞台与麦克风架，墙面悬挂喜字&#10;默认光线: 午间自然光由左侧落地窗斜入，与宴会厅暖色灯光（色温约3000K）交织，地面光洁形成大面积倒影与光斑&#10;气氛基调: 暖金与正红交织的喜庆色调，明亮通透，庄重而有仪式感&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;机位位于宴会厅后部入口处，视高约1.6米，地面平视广角镜头，横构图纳入整个大厅全貌：近景为最后排圆桌的白色桌布与香槟色椅背，中景为二十桌宴席沿中轴红色地毯通道对称纵深排开，远景为尽端小型舞台、麦克风架与喜字纱幔背景板。顶部成排水晶吊灯自前景延伸至舞台，左侧落地窗漏入的午间自然光在大理石地面拉出长条光带，与暖黄灯光在桌布上重叠。天花灯槽与墙面米金软包构成完整空间边界，整体色调暖金偏红，纵深感强烈。&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;机位移至中轴通道中段偏右，视高约1.4米，中景视角对准舞台前区与主通道交汇处——即迎宾与仪式展开的核心地带。红色地毯通道笔直通向舞台三级台阶，舞台台面深色木地板微微反光，中央矗立银色麦克风架，两侧摆放高身花艺与红金纱幔立柱。通道两侧最近的两桌圆宴清晰可见：白色桌布垂坠至地，香槟色椅套包裹椅背并系有金色蝴蝶结，桌面中央花艺、编号立牌与酒杯按位次排布。午间自然光斜落在舞台前沿与地毯上，与吊灯暖光在桌面形成冷暖交界的柔和光斑，地面倒影清晰。&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;特写镜头，机位贴近一桌宴席桌沿，视高约0.9米，浅景深虚化背景成排桌椅。画面主体为桌面陈设的材质与色彩层次：白色亚麻桌布细致织纹与自然垂褶，香槟色椅套的弹力布面与缎带光泽，中央花艺以白玫瑰、香槟玫瑰与红色果实相间插制，配暗金铜质花瓶；旁侧摆放高脚杯、骨质瓷餐具与红色喜糖盒，边缘露出红金桌卡与喜字纹样。侧逆的午间自然光在玻璃杯壁与银器上留下细亮高光，暖光则填亮花瓣暗部，质感细腻、明暗过渡柔和，集中呈现婚宴的正式与喜庆细节。&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位改为宴会厅左前侧二层回廊边缘，视高约3.2米，微俯斜角向下俯瞰全厅，与第1格机位高度和方向明确区别。画面呈对角线构图：近景为回廊栏杆与两侧墙面的喜字纱幔，中景为成排圆桌构成的白色弧形阵列与穿插其间的红色地毯通道，远景为舞台与背景板完整侧脸。顶部水晶吊灯由近及远层层排开，暖黄光点在地面大理石上连成倒影光带，左侧落地窗的午间自然光斜切整个大厅，勾出桌布与椅背的立体边缘。空间纵深、层高比例与建筑结构关系一目了然，光线、时段与天气与前三格完全一致。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维&#10;外貌：男性，年龄约三十岁上下，身高约一米八，体型匀称偏壮，肩背宽厚。方脸，颧骨略高，浓眉，内双，眼神精明而带压迫感，鼻梁挺直，嘴唇偏厚，下颌线硬朗。黑色短发，鬓角修短，皮肤偏小麦色，下巴有细微胡茬。身穿深色西装，白衬衫，系深色领带，西装剪裁合体，袖口平整，手指粗壮，戴一枚男士婚戒。整体气质强势现实。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新郎，沈念的未婚夫。他向林秀兰借款三十万并转给妹妹，隐瞒担保，婚宴上公开旧担保复印件逼迫沈念。他强势现实，仍要搬空老房，是冲突的核心人物。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;男性，年龄约三十岁上下，身高约一米八，体型匀称偏壮，肩背宽厚。方脸，颧骨略高，浓眉，内双，眼神精明而带压迫感，鼻梁挺直，嘴唇偏厚，下颌线硬朗。黑色短发，鬓角修短，皮肤偏小麦色，下巴有细微胡茬。身穿深色西装，白衬衫，系深色领带，西装剪裁合体，袖口平整，手指粗壮，戴一枚男士婚戒。整体气质强势现实。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: male only — masculine build and facial features; do not feminize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).&#10;&#10;沈念&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新娘，也是周维的未婚妻。婚宴上她当众追问母亲住处，揭穿三十万借款和担保问题，最终摘下戒指宣布不结婚。她冷静独立，对母亲的偏袒感到痛苦，仍试图带母亲离开。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台，周维从沈念右侧跨步上前，举起另一支话筒</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午间，舞台顶光在周维脸上投下硬朗阴影</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】中景&#10;【运镜】横摇&#10;【动作】周维从画面右侧跨步进入，举起话筒面向宾客，笑容饱满。镜头横摇跟随他的动作，将沈念留在画面左边缘。&#10;【对话】周维：&quot;岳母支持小家庭，以后跟我们住！&quot;&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】周维话音落下，宾客席响起整齐掌声，他转头看向沈念，笑意未达眼底。&#10;【情绪】虚伪</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维：&quot;岳母支持小家庭，以后跟我们住！&quot;</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维从画面右侧跨步进入，举起话筒面向宾客，笑容饱满。镜头横摇跟随他的动作，将沈念留在画面左边缘。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维话音落下，宾客席响起整齐掌声，他转头看向沈念，笑意未达眼底。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">顶光从周维头顶直下，眼窝投下阴影，掌声如潮水般涌来，暖黄灯光下喜庆表象与暗流并存</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台，周维从沈念右侧跨步上前，举起另一支话筒，午间，舞台顶光在周维脸上投下硬朗阴影，中景·平视·正面，周维从画面右侧跨步进入，举起话筒面向宾客，笑容饱满。镜头横摇跟随他的动作，将沈念留在画面左边缘，虚伪，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo，首帧静止画面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">场景：婚宴厅主舞台，周维从沈念右侧跨步上前，举起另一支话筒，午间，舞台顶光在周维脸上投下硬朗阴影。镜头标题：周维抢话。动作：周维从画面右侧跨步进入，举起话筒面向宾客，笑容饱满。镜头横摇跟随他的动作，将沈念留在画面左边缘。。对话：周维：&quot;岳母支持小家庭，以后跟我们住！&quot;。结果：周维话音落下，宾客席响起整齐掌声，他转头看向沈念，笑意未达眼底。。景别：中景。镜头角度：中景·平视·正面（medium shot (waist-up to full body), character and immediate surroundings visible, moderate depth of field, eye-level shot, neutral perspective, natural horizontal framing, shooting from the front）。运镜：横摇。氛围：顶光从周维头顶直下，眼窝投下阴影，掌声如潮水般涌来，暖黄灯光下喜庆表象与暗流并存。情绪：虚伪。音效：周维声音洪亮圆滑，宾客掌声热烈，夹杂零星叫好声。时长：6秒。风格：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo。=VideoRatio: 16:9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">4</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">4</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">协议落架</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第1幕·婚礼质问</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">10</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">特写</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">推镜</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅&#10;时间：午·内&#10;提示词：空无一人的酒店婚宴厅内部，午间自然光与宴会厅暖色灯光交织，二十桌圆形宴席整齐摆放，白色桌布、香槟色椅套、中央花艺、红金色婚礼布置，前方小型舞台和麦克风架，红色地毯通道，水晶吊灯，墙壁装饰喜字与纱幔，地面光洁反射灯光，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯场景背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内场景&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅，层高约六米，米金色软包墙面配红金婚礼布置；主材为抛光大理石地面、白色亚麻桌布、香槟色弹力椅套、水晶吊灯、纱幔与绒面地毯；二十桌圆形宴席分列中轴通道两侧，尽端为小型舞台与麦克风架，墙面悬挂喜字&#10;默认光线: 午间自然光由左侧落地窗斜入，与宴会厅暖色灯光（色温约3000K）交织，地面光洁形成大面积倒影与光斑&#10;气氛基调: 暖金与正红交织的喜庆色调，明亮通透，庄重而有仪式感&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;机位位于宴会厅后部入口处，视高约1.6米，地面平视广角镜头，横构图纳入整个大厅全貌：近景为最后排圆桌的白色桌布与香槟色椅背，中景为二十桌宴席沿中轴红色地毯通道对称纵深排开，远景为尽端小型舞台、麦克风架与喜字纱幔背景板。顶部成排水晶吊灯自前景延伸至舞台，左侧落地窗漏入的午间自然光在大理石地面拉出长条光带，与暖黄灯光在桌布上重叠。天花灯槽与墙面米金软包构成完整空间边界，整体色调暖金偏红，纵深感强烈。&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;机位移至中轴通道中段偏右，视高约1.4米，中景视角对准舞台前区与主通道交汇处——即迎宾与仪式展开的核心地带。红色地毯通道笔直通向舞台三级台阶，舞台台面深色木地板微微反光，中央矗立银色麦克风架，两侧摆放高身花艺与红金纱幔立柱。通道两侧最近的两桌圆宴清晰可见：白色桌布垂坠至地，香槟色椅套包裹椅背并系有金色蝴蝶结，桌面中央花艺、编号立牌与酒杯按位次排布。午间自然光斜落在舞台前沿与地毯上，与吊灯暖光在桌面形成冷暖交界的柔和光斑，地面倒影清晰。&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;特写镜头，机位贴近一桌宴席桌沿，视高约0.9米，浅景深虚化背景成排桌椅。画面主体为桌面陈设的材质与色彩层次：白色亚麻桌布细致织纹与自然垂褶，香槟色椅套的弹力布面与缎带光泽，中央花艺以白玫瑰、香槟玫瑰与红色果实相间插制，配暗金铜质花瓶；旁侧摆放高脚杯、骨质瓷餐具与红色喜糖盒，边缘露出红金桌卡与喜字纹样。侧逆的午间自然光在玻璃杯壁与银器上留下细亮高光，暖光则填亮花瓣暗部，质感细腻、明暗过渡柔和，集中呈现婚宴的正式与喜庆细节。&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位改为宴会厅左前侧二层回廊边缘，视高约3.2米，微俯斜角向下俯瞰全厅，与第1格机位高度和方向明确区别。画面呈对角线构图：近景为回廊栏杆与两侧墙面的喜字纱幔，中景为成排圆桌构成的白色弧形阵列与穿插其间的红色地毯通道，远景为舞台与背景板完整侧脸。顶部水晶吊灯由近及远层层排开，暖黄光点在地面大理石上连成倒影光带，左侧落地窗的午间自然光斜切整个大厅，勾出桌布与椅背的立体边缘。空间纵深、层高比例与建筑结构关系一目了然，光线、时段与天气与前三格完全一致。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新娘，也是周维的未婚妻。婚宴上她当众追问母亲住处，揭穿三十万借款和担保问题，最终摘下戒指宣布不结婚。她冷静独立，对母亲的偏袒感到痛苦，仍试图带母亲离开。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">售房协议&#10;类型：关键证物&#10;描述：林秀兰本人签署的房屋出售协议。婚宴上沈念将其放在话筒架上质问母亲售房后的住处；30万元为售房订金，随后被母亲借给周敏。与沈念另行签署的30万元旧担保严格区分。&#10;提示词：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，一份白色纸质协议平放在单一哑光纯色无缝棚拍背景上，画面中仅有这一份协议一个主体，纸张约A4大小，边缘有轻微卷曲和折痕，表面有黑色打印文字与手写签名栏，墨迹清晰，柔和均匀的棚拍光从上方照亮，无强烈反差阴影，无人物、手、家具、桌面、地面、室内外环境、散落杂物、其他道具、文字商标、包装、烟尘粒子，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台话筒架旁，白色桌布上放置着话筒架底座</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午间，舞台顶光在协议纸面形成强烈反光</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】特写&#10;【运镜】推镜&#10;【动作】沈念的手将一份折叠的售房协议展开，平放在话筒架底座上，手指用力压平纸张边角。镜头从俯视特写缓推向协议上的签名处。&#10;【对话】沈念：&quot;三十万进了我妈账户，当天转给你妹妹。你说借三天，今天第五天了。&quot;&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】协议平铺在话筒架上，签名处清晰可见，沈念的手收回，指尖微微发白。&#10;【情绪】决绝</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念：&quot;三十万进了我妈账户，当天转给你妹妹。你说借三天，今天第五天了。&quot;</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念的手将一份折叠的售房协议展开，平放在话筒架底座上，手指用力压平纸张边角。镜头从俯视特写缓推向协议上的签名处。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">协议平铺在话筒架上，签名处清晰可见，沈念的手收回，指尖微微发白。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">顶光直射纸面形成高反差，白纸黑字如刀锋般锐利，背景掌声骤停，空气凝固</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台话筒架旁，白色桌布上放置着话筒架底座，午间，舞台顶光在协议纸面形成强烈反光，特写·俯拍·正面，沈念的手将一份折叠的售房协议展开，平放在话筒架底座上，手指用力压平纸张边角。镜头从俯视特写缓推向协议上的签名处，决绝，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo，首帧静止画面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">场景：婚宴厅主舞台话筒架旁，白色桌布上放置着话筒架底座，午间，舞台顶光在协议纸面形成强烈反光。镜头标题：协议落架。动作：沈念的手将一份折叠的售房协议展开，平放在话筒架底座上，手指用力压平纸张边角。镜头从俯视特写缓推向协议上的签名处。。对话：沈念：&quot;三十万进了我妈账户，当天转给你妹妹。你说借三天，今天第五天了。&quot;。结果：协议平铺在话筒架上，签名处清晰可见，沈念的手收回，指尖微微发白。。景别：特写。镜头角度：特写·俯拍·正面（close-up shot (face/bust framing), subject fills most of frame, shallow depth of field, background softly blurred, high-angle bird's eye view, camera above looking down, background shows floor/ground with downward perspective distortion, shooting from the front）。运镜：推镜。氛围：顶光直射纸面形成高反差，白纸黑字如刀锋般锐利，背景掌声骤停，空气凝固。情绪：决绝。音效：纸张展开的清脆摩擦声，沈念声音冷硬如冰，全场瞬间安静。时长：10秒。风格：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo。=VideoRatio: 16:9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">5</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">5</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">母亲攥袋</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第1幕·婚礼质问</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">12</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">近景</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">推镜</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅&#10;时间：午·内&#10;提示词：空无一人的酒店婚宴厅内部，午间自然光与宴会厅暖色灯光交织，二十桌圆形宴席整齐摆放，白色桌布、香槟色椅套、中央花艺、红金色婚礼布置，前方小型舞台和麦克风架，红色地毯通道，水晶吊灯，墙壁装饰喜字与纱幔，地面光洁反射灯光，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯场景背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内场景&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅，层高约六米，米金色软包墙面配红金婚礼布置；主材为抛光大理石地面、白色亚麻桌布、香槟色弹力椅套、水晶吊灯、纱幔与绒面地毯；二十桌圆形宴席分列中轴通道两侧，尽端为小型舞台与麦克风架，墙面悬挂喜字&#10;默认光线: 午间自然光由左侧落地窗斜入，与宴会厅暖色灯光（色温约3000K）交织，地面光洁形成大面积倒影与光斑&#10;气氛基调: 暖金与正红交织的喜庆色调，明亮通透，庄重而有仪式感&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;机位位于宴会厅后部入口处，视高约1.6米，地面平视广角镜头，横构图纳入整个大厅全貌：近景为最后排圆桌的白色桌布与香槟色椅背，中景为二十桌宴席沿中轴红色地毯通道对称纵深排开，远景为尽端小型舞台、麦克风架与喜字纱幔背景板。顶部成排水晶吊灯自前景延伸至舞台，左侧落地窗漏入的午间自然光在大理石地面拉出长条光带，与暖黄灯光在桌布上重叠。天花灯槽与墙面米金软包构成完整空间边界，整体色调暖金偏红，纵深感强烈。&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;机位移至中轴通道中段偏右，视高约1.4米，中景视角对准舞台前区与主通道交汇处——即迎宾与仪式展开的核心地带。红色地毯通道笔直通向舞台三级台阶，舞台台面深色木地板微微反光，中央矗立银色麦克风架，两侧摆放高身花艺与红金纱幔立柱。通道两侧最近的两桌圆宴清晰可见：白色桌布垂坠至地，香槟色椅套包裹椅背并系有金色蝴蝶结，桌面中央花艺、编号立牌与酒杯按位次排布。午间自然光斜落在舞台前沿与地毯上，与吊灯暖光在桌面形成冷暖交界的柔和光斑，地面倒影清晰。&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;特写镜头，机位贴近一桌宴席桌沿，视高约0.9米，浅景深虚化背景成排桌椅。画面主体为桌面陈设的材质与色彩层次：白色亚麻桌布细致织纹与自然垂褶，香槟色椅套的弹力布面与缎带光泽，中央花艺以白玫瑰、香槟玫瑰与红色果实相间插制，配暗金铜质花瓶；旁侧摆放高脚杯、骨质瓷餐具与红色喜糖盒，边缘露出红金桌卡与喜字纹样。侧逆的午间自然光在玻璃杯壁与银器上留下细亮高光，暖光则填亮花瓣暗部，质感细腻、明暗过渡柔和，集中呈现婚宴的正式与喜庆细节。&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位改为宴会厅左前侧二层回廊边缘，视高约3.2米，微俯斜角向下俯瞰全厅，与第1格机位高度和方向明确区别。画面呈对角线构图：近景为回廊栏杆与两侧墙面的喜字纱幔，中景为成排圆桌构成的白色弧形阵列与穿插其间的红色地毯通道，远景为舞台与背景板完整侧脸。顶部水晶吊灯由近及远层层排开，暖黄光点在地面大理石上连成倒影光带，左侧落地窗的午间自然光斜切整个大厅，勾出桌布与椅背的立体边缘。空间纵深、层高比例与建筑结构关系一目了然，光线、时段与天气与前三格完全一致。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">林秀兰&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约五十六七岁，体型偏瘦，背略佝偻。圆脸，颧骨微凸，眼角与嘴角有细纹，眉色浅淡，眼神疲惫躲闪，鼻翼较宽，嘴唇干薄。头发花白掺杂，短卷发梳理整齐，皮肤暗黄，有老年斑和真实皮肤纹理。身穿暗紫红色针织开衫，内搭深色衬衫，下穿黑色长裤，手拿旧式手袋，手指关节明显。整体气质操劳隐忍。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：沈念的母亲。她卖掉老房支持女儿婚房，借款给周维并签协议，婚礼上试图维持局面，最后把老房钥匙交给周维。她偏袒周维，与女儿关系紧张。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约五十六七岁，体型偏瘦，背略佝偻。圆脸，颧骨微凸，眼角与嘴角有细纹，眉色浅淡，眼神疲惫躲闪，鼻翼较宽，嘴唇干薄。头发花白掺杂，短卷发梳理整齐，皮肤暗黄，有老年斑和真实皮肤纹理。身穿暗紫红色针织开衫，内搭深色衬衫，下穿黑色长裤，手拿旧式手袋，手指关节明显。整体气质操劳隐忍。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅宾客席，林秀兰坐在第二排，手袋放在膝上，周围宾客目光聚焦舞台</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午间，宾客席间光线偏暗，侧光勾勒林秀兰轮廓</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】近景&#10;【运镜】推镜&#10;【动作】林秀兰双手攥紧膝上的手袋，指节发白，嘴唇翕动。镜头从近景缓推，背景宾客虚化，她独自坐在人群中如孤岛。&#10;【对话】林秀兰：&quot;他发过项目照片和地址，我看过。说三天回款，我才借。协议也是我自己签的，今天别问了。&quot;&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】林秀兰说完垂下眼睑，手袋被攥出深深褶皱，邻座宾客侧目低语。&#10;【情绪】羞愧</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">林秀兰：&quot;他发过项目照片和地址，我看过。说三天回款，我才借。协议也是我自己签的，今天别问了。&quot;</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">林秀兰双手攥紧膝上的手袋，指节发白，嘴唇翕动。镜头从近景缓推，背景宾客虚化，她独自坐在人群中如孤岛。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">林秀兰说完垂下眼睑，手袋被攥出深深褶皱，邻座宾客侧目低语。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">侧光从左侧打来，右脸陷入阴影，周围宾客虚化成模糊色块，氛围压抑而孤立</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅宾客席，林秀兰坐在第二排，手袋放在膝上，周围宾客目光聚焦舞台，午间，宾客席间光线偏暗，侧光勾勒林秀兰轮廓，特写·平视·正面，林秀兰双手攥紧膝上的手袋，指节发白，嘴唇翕动。镜头从近景缓推，背景宾客虚化，她独自坐在人群中如孤岛，羞愧，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo，首帧静止画面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">场景：婚宴厅宾客席，林秀兰坐在第二排，手袋放在膝上，周围宾客目光聚焦舞台，午间，宾客席间光线偏暗，侧光勾勒林秀兰轮廓。镜头标题：母亲攥袋。动作：林秀兰双手攥紧膝上的手袋，指节发白，嘴唇翕动。镜头从近景缓推，背景宾客虚化，她独自坐在人群中如孤岛。。对话：林秀兰：&quot;他发过项目照片和地址，我看过。说三天回款，我才借。协议也是我自己签的，今天别问了。&quot;。结果：林秀兰说完垂下眼睑，手袋被攥出深深褶皱，邻座宾客侧目低语。。景别：近景。镜头角度：特写·平视·正面（close-up shot (face/bust framing), subject fills most of frame, shallow depth of field, background softly blurred, eye-level shot, neutral perspective, natural horizontal framing, shooting from the front）。运镜：推镜。氛围：侧光从左侧打来，右脸陷入阴影，周围宾客虚化成模糊色块，氛围压抑而孤立。情绪：羞愧。音效：林秀兰声音低沉沙哑，带着恳求的颤音，周围宾客窃窃私语。时长：12秒。风格：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo。=VideoRatio: 16:9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">6</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">6</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维耳语</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第1幕·婚礼质问</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">8</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">特写</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">推镜</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅&#10;时间：午·内&#10;提示词：空无一人的酒店婚宴厅内部，午间自然光与宴会厅暖色灯光交织，二十桌圆形宴席整齐摆放，白色桌布、香槟色椅套、中央花艺、红金色婚礼布置，前方小型舞台和麦克风架，红色地毯通道，水晶吊灯，墙壁装饰喜字与纱幔，地面光洁反射灯光，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯场景背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内场景&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅，层高约六米，米金色软包墙面配红金婚礼布置；主材为抛光大理石地面、白色亚麻桌布、香槟色弹力椅套、水晶吊灯、纱幔与绒面地毯；二十桌圆形宴席分列中轴通道两侧，尽端为小型舞台与麦克风架，墙面悬挂喜字&#10;默认光线: 午间自然光由左侧落地窗斜入，与宴会厅暖色灯光（色温约3000K）交织，地面光洁形成大面积倒影与光斑&#10;气氛基调: 暖金与正红交织的喜庆色调，明亮通透，庄重而有仪式感&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;机位位于宴会厅后部入口处，视高约1.6米，地面平视广角镜头，横构图纳入整个大厅全貌：近景为最后排圆桌的白色桌布与香槟色椅背，中景为二十桌宴席沿中轴红色地毯通道对称纵深排开，远景为尽端小型舞台、麦克风架与喜字纱幔背景板。顶部成排水晶吊灯自前景延伸至舞台，左侧落地窗漏入的午间自然光在大理石地面拉出长条光带，与暖黄灯光在桌布上重叠。天花灯槽与墙面米金软包构成完整空间边界，整体色调暖金偏红，纵深感强烈。&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;机位移至中轴通道中段偏右，视高约1.4米，中景视角对准舞台前区与主通道交汇处——即迎宾与仪式展开的核心地带。红色地毯通道笔直通向舞台三级台阶，舞台台面深色木地板微微反光，中央矗立银色麦克风架，两侧摆放高身花艺与红金纱幔立柱。通道两侧最近的两桌圆宴清晰可见：白色桌布垂坠至地，香槟色椅套包裹椅背并系有金色蝴蝶结，桌面中央花艺、编号立牌与酒杯按位次排布。午间自然光斜落在舞台前沿与地毯上，与吊灯暖光在桌面形成冷暖交界的柔和光斑，地面倒影清晰。&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;特写镜头，机位贴近一桌宴席桌沿，视高约0.9米，浅景深虚化背景成排桌椅。画面主体为桌面陈设的材质与色彩层次：白色亚麻桌布细致织纹与自然垂褶，香槟色椅套的弹力布面与缎带光泽，中央花艺以白玫瑰、香槟玫瑰与红色果实相间插制，配暗金铜质花瓶；旁侧摆放高脚杯、骨质瓷餐具与红色喜糖盒，边缘露出红金桌卡与喜字纹样。侧逆的午间自然光在玻璃杯壁与银器上留下细亮高光，暖光则填亮花瓣暗部，质感细腻、明暗过渡柔和，集中呈现婚宴的正式与喜庆细节。&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位改为宴会厅左前侧二层回廊边缘，视高约3.2米，微俯斜角向下俯瞰全厅，与第1格机位高度和方向明确区别。画面呈对角线构图：近景为回廊栏杆与两侧墙面的喜字纱幔，中景为成排圆桌构成的白色弧形阵列与穿插其间的红色地毯通道，远景为舞台与背景板完整侧脸。顶部水晶吊灯由近及远层层排开，暖黄光点在地面大理石上连成倒影光带，左侧落地窗的午间自然光斜切整个大厅，勾出桌布与椅背的立体边缘。空间纵深、层高比例与建筑结构关系一目了然，光线、时段与天气与前三格完全一致。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新娘，也是周维的未婚妻。婚宴上她当众追问母亲住处，揭穿三十万借款和担保问题，最终摘下戒指宣布不结婚。她冷静独立，对母亲的偏袒感到痛苦，仍试图带母亲离开。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).&#10;&#10;周维&#10;外貌：男性，年龄约三十岁上下，身高约一米八，体型匀称偏壮，肩背宽厚。方脸，颧骨略高，浓眉，内双，眼神精明而带压迫感，鼻梁挺直，嘴唇偏厚，下颌线硬朗。黑色短发，鬓角修短，皮肤偏小麦色，下巴有细微胡茬。身穿深色西装，白衬衫，系深色领带，西装剪裁合体，袖口平整，手指粗壮，戴一枚男士婚戒。整体气质强势现实。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新郎，沈念的未婚夫。他向林秀兰借款三十万并转给妹妹，隐瞒担保，婚宴上公开旧担保复印件逼迫沈念。他强势现实，仍要搬空老房，是冲突的核心人物。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;男性，年龄约三十岁上下，身高约一米八，体型匀称偏壮，肩背宽厚。方脸，颧骨略高，浓眉，内双，眼神精明而带压迫感，鼻梁挺直，嘴唇偏厚，下颌线硬朗。黑色短发，鬓角修短，皮肤偏小麦色，下巴有细微胡茬。身穿深色西装，白衬衫，系深色领带，西装剪裁合体，袖口平整，手指粗壮，戴一枚男士婚戒。整体气质强势现实。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: male only — masculine build and facial features; do not feminize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台，周维侧身靠近沈念，嘴唇几乎贴着她耳廓</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午间，舞台侧光在两人面部形成明暗交界</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】特写&#10;【运镜】推镜&#10;【动作】周维侧身靠近沈念，嘴唇贴近她耳边，压低声音。镜头从侧面特写缓推，两人面部占据画面，背景完全虚化。&#10;【对话】周维：&quot;你给我签的担保，也还没解决。一定要让所有人知道？&quot;&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】周维说完微微退开，嘴角挂着若有若无的笑，沈念面无表情直视前方。&#10;【情绪】威胁</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维：&quot;你给我签的担保，也还没解决。一定要让所有人知道？&quot;</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维侧身靠近沈念，嘴唇贴近她耳边，压低声音。镜头从侧面特写缓推，两人面部占据画面，背景完全虚化。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维说完微微退开，嘴角挂着若有若无的笑，沈念面无表情直视前方。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">侧光将两人面部切成明暗两半，周维半张脸在阴影中，氛围阴冷而充满威胁</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台，周维侧身靠近沈念，嘴唇几乎贴着她耳廓，午间，舞台侧光在两人面部形成明暗交界，特写·平视·左侧，周维侧身靠近沈念，嘴唇贴近她耳边，压低声音。镜头从侧面特写缓推，两人面部占据画面，背景完全虚化，威胁，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo，首帧静止画面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">场景：婚宴厅主舞台，周维侧身靠近沈念，嘴唇几乎贴着她耳廓，午间，舞台侧光在两人面部形成明暗交界。镜头标题：周维耳语。动作：周维侧身靠近沈念，嘴唇贴近她耳边，压低声音。镜头从侧面特写缓推，两人面部占据画面，背景完全虚化。。对话：周维：&quot;你给我签的担保，也还没解决。一定要让所有人知道？&quot;。结果：周维说完微微退开，嘴角挂着若有若无的笑，沈念面无表情直视前方。。景别：特写。镜头角度：特写·平视·左侧（close-up shot (face/bust framing), subject fills most of frame, shallow depth of field, background softly blurred, eye-level shot, neutral perspective, natural horizontal framing, shooting from the left side, profile view）。运镜：推镜。氛围：侧光将两人面部切成明暗两半，周维半张脸在阴影中，氛围阴冷而充满威胁。情绪：威胁。音效：周维声音压至极低，气息声清晰可闻，阴冷如蛇。时长：8秒。风格：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo。=VideoRatio: 16:9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">7</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">7</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">摘下戒指</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第1幕·婚礼质问</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">6</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">特写</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">推镜</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅&#10;时间：午·内&#10;提示词：空无一人的酒店婚宴厅内部，午间自然光与宴会厅暖色灯光交织，二十桌圆形宴席整齐摆放，白色桌布、香槟色椅套、中央花艺、红金色婚礼布置，前方小型舞台和麦克风架，红色地毯通道，水晶吊灯，墙壁装饰喜字与纱幔，地面光洁反射灯光，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯场景背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内场景&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅，层高约六米，米金色软包墙面配红金婚礼布置；主材为抛光大理石地面、白色亚麻桌布、香槟色弹力椅套、水晶吊灯、纱幔与绒面地毯；二十桌圆形宴席分列中轴通道两侧，尽端为小型舞台与麦克风架，墙面悬挂喜字&#10;默认光线: 午间自然光由左侧落地窗斜入，与宴会厅暖色灯光（色温约3000K）交织，地面光洁形成大面积倒影与光斑&#10;气氛基调: 暖金与正红交织的喜庆色调，明亮通透，庄重而有仪式感&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;机位位于宴会厅后部入口处，视高约1.6米，地面平视广角镜头，横构图纳入整个大厅全貌：近景为最后排圆桌的白色桌布与香槟色椅背，中景为二十桌宴席沿中轴红色地毯通道对称纵深排开，远景为尽端小型舞台、麦克风架与喜字纱幔背景板。顶部成排水晶吊灯自前景延伸至舞台，左侧落地窗漏入的午间自然光在大理石地面拉出长条光带，与暖黄灯光在桌布上重叠。天花灯槽与墙面米金软包构成完整空间边界，整体色调暖金偏红，纵深感强烈。&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;机位移至中轴通道中段偏右，视高约1.4米，中景视角对准舞台前区与主通道交汇处——即迎宾与仪式展开的核心地带。红色地毯通道笔直通向舞台三级台阶，舞台台面深色木地板微微反光，中央矗立银色麦克风架，两侧摆放高身花艺与红金纱幔立柱。通道两侧最近的两桌圆宴清晰可见：白色桌布垂坠至地，香槟色椅套包裹椅背并系有金色蝴蝶结，桌面中央花艺、编号立牌与酒杯按位次排布。午间自然光斜落在舞台前沿与地毯上，与吊灯暖光在桌面形成冷暖交界的柔和光斑，地面倒影清晰。&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;特写镜头，机位贴近一桌宴席桌沿，视高约0.9米，浅景深虚化背景成排桌椅。画面主体为桌面陈设的材质与色彩层次：白色亚麻桌布细致织纹与自然垂褶，香槟色椅套的弹力布面与缎带光泽，中央花艺以白玫瑰、香槟玫瑰与红色果实相间插制，配暗金铜质花瓶；旁侧摆放高脚杯、骨质瓷餐具与红色喜糖盒，边缘露出红金桌卡与喜字纹样。侧逆的午间自然光在玻璃杯壁与银器上留下细亮高光，暖光则填亮花瓣暗部，质感细腻、明暗过渡柔和，集中呈现婚宴的正式与喜庆细节。&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位改为宴会厅左前侧二层回廊边缘，视高约3.2米，微俯斜角向下俯瞰全厅，与第1格机位高度和方向明确区别。画面呈对角线构图：近景为回廊栏杆与两侧墙面的喜字纱幔，中景为成排圆桌构成的白色弧形阵列与穿插其间的红色地毯通道，远景为舞台与背景板完整侧脸。顶部水晶吊灯由近及远层层排开，暖黄光点在地面大理石上连成倒影光带，左侧落地窗的午间自然光斜切整个大厅，勾出桌布与椅背的立体边缘。空间纵深、层高比例与建筑结构关系一目了然，光线、时段与天气与前三格完全一致。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新娘，也是周维的未婚妻。婚宴上她当众追问母亲住处，揭穿三十万借款和担保问题，最终摘下戒指宣布不结婚。她冷静独立，对母亲的偏袒感到痛苦，仍试图带母亲离开。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">结婚戒指&#10;类型：关键证物&#10;描述：沈念在婚宴上慢慢摘下并放进自己手袋的戒指，是宣告“这婚不结了”的核心视觉符号。戒指为常见贵金属材质，表面光滑，有细腻的金属光泽和轻微佩戴痕迹，内圈可见细微磨砂感，整体小巧精致。它在剧中承载着婚姻承诺的象征意义，摘下戒指的动作直接标志沈念当众悔婚，是全场情绪转折的关键道具。&#10;提示词：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，一枚小巧的贵金属戒指放置在单一哑光纯色无缝棚拍背景上，画面中仅有这一枚戒指一个主体，表面光滑有细腻金属光泽，内圈有细微磨砂感，边缘有轻微佩戴痕迹，柔和均匀的棚拍光从上方照亮，无强烈反差阴影，无人物、手、家具、桌面、地面、室内外环境、散落杂物、其他道具、文字商标、包装、烟尘粒子，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台，沈念左手无名指，手袋开口在画面下方</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午间，舞台顶光聚焦手部，戒指反射冷光</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】特写&#10;【运镜】推镜&#10;【动作】沈念低头看着左手，右手缓缓将结婚戒指从无名指上褪下。镜头从俯视特写缓推，戒指脱离手指的瞬间在灯光下闪了一下，然后被放入手袋。&#10;【对话】沈念：&quot;这婚不结了。&quot;&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】戒指落入黑色手袋深处消失，沈念合上手袋扣，金属扣发出清脆声响。&#10;【情绪】决绝</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念：&quot;这婚不结了。&quot;</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念低头看着左手，右手缓缓将结婚戒指从无名指上褪下。镜头从俯视特写缓推，戒指脱离手指的瞬间在灯光下闪了一下，然后被放入手袋。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">戒指落入黑色手袋深处消失，沈念合上手袋扣，金属扣发出清脆声响。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">顶光聚焦手部形成强烈高光，周围环境压暗，戒指冷光一闪如刀锋，氛围决绝而冰冷</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台，沈念左手无名指，手袋开口在画面下方，午间，舞台顶光聚焦手部，戒指反射冷光，特写·俯拍·正面，沈念低头看着左手，右手缓缓将结婚戒指从无名指上褪下。镜头从俯视特写缓推，戒指脱离手指的瞬间在灯光下闪了一下，决绝，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo，首帧静止画面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">场景：婚宴厅主舞台，沈念左手无名指，手袋开口在画面下方，午间，舞台顶光聚焦手部，戒指反射冷光。镜头标题：摘下戒指。动作：沈念低头看着左手，右手缓缓将结婚戒指从无名指上褪下。镜头从俯视特写缓推，戒指脱离手指的瞬间在灯光下闪了一下，然后被放入手袋。。对话：沈念：&quot;这婚不结了。&quot;。结果：戒指落入黑色手袋深处消失，沈念合上手袋扣，金属扣发出清脆声响。。景别：特写。镜头角度：特写·俯拍·正面（close-up shot (face/bust framing), subject fills most of frame, shallow depth of field, background softly blurred, high-angle bird's eye view, camera above looking down, background shows floor/ground with downward perspective distortion, shooting from the front）。运镜：推镜。氛围：顶光聚焦手部形成强烈高光，周围环境压暗，戒指冷光一闪如刀锋，氛围决绝而冰冷。情绪：决绝。音效：戒指滑落金属摩擦声，手袋扣合清脆一响，沈念声音平静如死水。时长：6秒。风格：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo。=VideoRatio: 16:9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">8</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">8</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">甩手啸叫</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第1幕·婚礼质问</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">5</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">中景</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">手持</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅&#10;时间：午·内&#10;提示词：空无一人的酒店婚宴厅内部，午间自然光与宴会厅暖色灯光交织，二十桌圆形宴席整齐摆放，白色桌布、香槟色椅套、中央花艺、红金色婚礼布置，前方小型舞台和麦克风架，红色地毯通道，水晶吊灯，墙壁装饰喜字与纱幔，地面光洁反射灯光，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯场景背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内场景&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅，层高约六米，米金色软包墙面配红金婚礼布置；主材为抛光大理石地面、白色亚麻桌布、香槟色弹力椅套、水晶吊灯、纱幔与绒面地毯；二十桌圆形宴席分列中轴通道两侧，尽端为小型舞台与麦克风架，墙面悬挂喜字&#10;默认光线: 午间自然光由左侧落地窗斜入，与宴会厅暖色灯光（色温约3000K）交织，地面光洁形成大面积倒影与光斑&#10;气氛基调: 暖金与正红交织的喜庆色调，明亮通透，庄重而有仪式感&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;机位位于宴会厅后部入口处，视高约1.6米，地面平视广角镜头，横构图纳入整个大厅全貌：近景为最后排圆桌的白色桌布与香槟色椅背，中景为二十桌宴席沿中轴红色地毯通道对称纵深排开，远景为尽端小型舞台、麦克风架与喜字纱幔背景板。顶部成排水晶吊灯自前景延伸至舞台，左侧落地窗漏入的午间自然光在大理石地面拉出长条光带，与暖黄灯光在桌布上重叠。天花灯槽与墙面米金软包构成完整空间边界，整体色调暖金偏红，纵深感强烈。&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;机位移至中轴通道中段偏右，视高约1.4米，中景视角对准舞台前区与主通道交汇处——即迎宾与仪式展开的核心地带。红色地毯通道笔直通向舞台三级台阶，舞台台面深色木地板微微反光，中央矗立银色麦克风架，两侧摆放高身花艺与红金纱幔立柱。通道两侧最近的两桌圆宴清晰可见：白色桌布垂坠至地，香槟色椅套包裹椅背并系有金色蝴蝶结，桌面中央花艺、编号立牌与酒杯按位次排布。午间自然光斜落在舞台前沿与地毯上，与吊灯暖光在桌面形成冷暖交界的柔和光斑，地面倒影清晰。&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;特写镜头，机位贴近一桌宴席桌沿，视高约0.9米，浅景深虚化背景成排桌椅。画面主体为桌面陈设的材质与色彩层次：白色亚麻桌布细致织纹与自然垂褶，香槟色椅套的弹力布面与缎带光泽，中央花艺以白玫瑰、香槟玫瑰与红色果实相间插制，配暗金铜质花瓶；旁侧摆放高脚杯、骨质瓷餐具与红色喜糖盒，边缘露出红金桌卡与喜字纹样。侧逆的午间自然光在玻璃杯壁与银器上留下细亮高光，暖光则填亮花瓣暗部，质感细腻、明暗过渡柔和，集中呈现婚宴的正式与喜庆细节。&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位改为宴会厅左前侧二层回廊边缘，视高约3.2米，微俯斜角向下俯瞰全厅，与第1格机位高度和方向明确区别。画面呈对角线构图：近景为回廊栏杆与两侧墙面的喜字纱幔，中景为成排圆桌构成的白色弧形阵列与穿插其间的红色地毯通道，远景为舞台与背景板完整侧脸。顶部水晶吊灯由近及远层层排开，暖黄光点在地面大理石上连成倒影光带，左侧落地窗的午间自然光斜切整个大厅，勾出桌布与椅背的立体边缘。空间纵深、层高比例与建筑结构关系一目了然，光线、时段与天气与前三格完全一致。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新娘，也是周维的未婚妻。婚宴上她当众追问母亲住处，揭穿三十万借款和担保问题，最终摘下戒指宣布不结婚。她冷静独立，对母亲的偏袒感到痛苦，仍试图带母亲离开。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).&#10;&#10;周维&#10;外貌：男性，年龄约三十岁上下，身高约一米八，体型匀称偏壮，肩背宽厚。方脸，颧骨略高，浓眉，内双，眼神精明而带压迫感，鼻梁挺直，嘴唇偏厚，下颌线硬朗。黑色短发，鬓角修短，皮肤偏小麦色，下巴有细微胡茬。身穿深色西装，白衬衫，系深色领带，西装剪裁合体，袖口平整，手指粗壮，戴一枚男士婚戒。整体气质强势现实。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新郎，沈念的未婚夫。他向林秀兰借款三十万并转给妹妹，隐瞒担保，婚宴上公开旧担保复印件逼迫沈念。他强势现实，仍要搬空老房，是冲突的核心人物。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;男性，年龄约三十岁上下，身高约一米八，体型匀称偏壮，肩背宽厚。方脸，颧骨略高，浓眉，内双，眼神精明而带压迫感，鼻梁挺直，嘴唇偏厚，下颌线硬朗。黑色短发，鬓角修短，皮肤偏小麦色，下巴有细微胡茬。身穿深色西装，白衬衫，系深色领带，西装剪裁合体，袖口平整，手指粗壮，戴一枚男士婚戒。整体气质强势现实。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: male only — masculine build and facial features; do not feminize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台，话筒架位于沈念与周维之间，桌边摆放着香槟塔</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午间，舞台灯光在剧烈动作中产生拖影</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】中景&#10;【运镜】手持&#10;【动作】周维伸手抓住沈念手腕，沈念猛地甩开。手肘撞到话筒架，话筒飞出去砸在桌边，发出刺耳啸叫。镜头手持跟拍两人拉扯，画面剧烈晃动。&#10;【对话】&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】话筒落地滚入桌下，啸叫声持续三秒后被切断，全场宾客捂耳惊呼，周维踉跄后退一步。&#10;【情绪】爆发</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维抓住沈念手腕，她甩开，话筒撞在桌边发出刺耳啸叫。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念脱开周维的手；话筒留在桌边，不飞出或滚入桌下。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">灯光在晃动中产生频闪效果，啸叫刺穿整个宴会厅，喜庆氛围瞬间碎裂</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅内，周维抓住沈念手腕；沈念准备甩开，话筒在桌边。中景，写实摄影。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维抓住沈念手腕，她甩开，话筒撞在桌边发出刺耳啸叫。 沈念脱开周维的手；话筒留在桌边，不飞出或滚入桌下。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">举担保书</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第1幕·婚礼质问</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">7</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">中景</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">拉镜</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅&#10;时间：午·内&#10;提示词：空无一人的酒店婚宴厅内部，午间自然光与宴会厅暖色灯光交织，二十桌圆形宴席整齐摆放，白色桌布、香槟色椅套、中央花艺、红金色婚礼布置，前方小型舞台和麦克风架，红色地毯通道，水晶吊灯，墙壁装饰喜字与纱幔，地面光洁反射灯光，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯场景背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内场景&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅，层高约六米，米金色软包墙面配红金婚礼布置；主材为抛光大理石地面、白色亚麻桌布、香槟色弹力椅套、水晶吊灯、纱幔与绒面地毯；二十桌圆形宴席分列中轴通道两侧，尽端为小型舞台与麦克风架，墙面悬挂喜字&#10;默认光线: 午间自然光由左侧落地窗斜入，与宴会厅暖色灯光（色温约3000K）交织，地面光洁形成大面积倒影与光斑&#10;气氛基调: 暖金与正红交织的喜庆色调，明亮通透，庄重而有仪式感&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;机位位于宴会厅后部入口处，视高约1.6米，地面平视广角镜头，横构图纳入整个大厅全貌：近景为最后排圆桌的白色桌布与香槟色椅背，中景为二十桌宴席沿中轴红色地毯通道对称纵深排开，远景为尽端小型舞台、麦克风架与喜字纱幔背景板。顶部成排水晶吊灯自前景延伸至舞台，左侧落地窗漏入的午间自然光在大理石地面拉出长条光带，与暖黄灯光在桌布上重叠。天花灯槽与墙面米金软包构成完整空间边界，整体色调暖金偏红，纵深感强烈。&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;机位移至中轴通道中段偏右，视高约1.4米，中景视角对准舞台前区与主通道交汇处——即迎宾与仪式展开的核心地带。红色地毯通道笔直通向舞台三级台阶，舞台台面深色木地板微微反光，中央矗立银色麦克风架，两侧摆放高身花艺与红金纱幔立柱。通道两侧最近的两桌圆宴清晰可见：白色桌布垂坠至地，香槟色椅套包裹椅背并系有金色蝴蝶结，桌面中央花艺、编号立牌与酒杯按位次排布。午间自然光斜落在舞台前沿与地毯上，与吊灯暖光在桌面形成冷暖交界的柔和光斑，地面倒影清晰。&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;特写镜头，机位贴近一桌宴席桌沿，视高约0.9米，浅景深虚化背景成排桌椅。画面主体为桌面陈设的材质与色彩层次：白色亚麻桌布细致织纹与自然垂褶，香槟色椅套的弹力布面与缎带光泽，中央花艺以白玫瑰、香槟玫瑰与红色果实相间插制，配暗金铜质花瓶；旁侧摆放高脚杯、骨质瓷餐具与红色喜糖盒，边缘露出红金桌卡与喜字纹样。侧逆的午间自然光在玻璃杯壁与银器上留下细亮高光，暖光则填亮花瓣暗部，质感细腻、明暗过渡柔和，集中呈现婚宴的正式与喜庆细节。&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位改为宴会厅左前侧二层回廊边缘，视高约3.2米，微俯斜角向下俯瞰全厅，与第1格机位高度和方向明确区别。画面呈对角线构图：近景为回廊栏杆与两侧墙面的喜字纱幔，中景为成排圆桌构成的白色弧形阵列与穿插其间的红色地毯通道，远景为舞台与背景板完整侧脸。顶部水晶吊灯由近及远层层排开，暖黄光点在地面大理石上连成倒影光带，左侧落地窗的午间自然光斜切整个大厅，勾出桌布与椅背的立体边缘。空间纵深、层高比例与建筑结构关系一目了然，光线、时段与天气与前三格完全一致。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维&#10;外貌：男性，年龄约三十岁上下，身高约一米八，体型匀称偏壮，肩背宽厚。方脸，颧骨略高，浓眉，内双，眼神精明而带压迫感，鼻梁挺直，嘴唇偏厚，下颌线硬朗。黑色短发，鬓角修短，皮肤偏小麦色，下巴有细微胡茬。身穿深色西装，白衬衫，系深色领带，西装剪裁合体，袖口平整，手指粗壮，戴一枚男士婚戒。整体气质强势现实。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新郎，沈念的未婚夫。他向林秀兰借款三十万并转给妹妹，隐瞒担保，婚宴上公开旧担保复印件逼迫沈念。他强势现实，仍要搬空老房，是冲突的核心人物。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;男性，年龄约三十岁上下，身高约一米八，体型匀称偏壮，肩背宽厚。方脸，颧骨略高，浓眉，内双，眼神精明而带压迫感，鼻梁挺直，嘴唇偏厚，下颌线硬朗。黑色短发，鬓角修短，皮肤偏小麦色，下巴有细微胡茬。身穿深色西装，白衬衫，系深色领带，西装剪裁合体，袖口平整，手指粗壮，戴一枚男士婚戒。整体气质强势现实。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: male only — masculine build and facial features; do not feminize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">旧担保复印件&#10;类型：关键证物&#10;描述：周维举向宾客的旧担保复印件，对应沈念另行签署的30万元担保。沈念承认自己签过，要求查清；她拒绝混同或追加其他债务，不能描述为否认全部责任。&#10;提示词：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，一张白色旧担保复印件平放在单一哑光纯色无缝棚拍背景上，画面中仅有这一张复印件一个主体，纸张约A4大小，布满明显折叠痕迹，边缘有磨损和毛边，纸面有黑色复印文字与签名栏，复印墨色略淡，局部轻微晕染，柔和均匀的棚拍光从上方照亮，无强烈反差阴影，无人物、手、家具、桌面、地面、室内外环境、散落杂物、其他道具、文字商标、包装、烟尘粒子，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台，周维站在舞台边缘面向二十桌宾客，手中举着泛黄的担保复印件</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午间，舞台顶光从周维头顶打下，面部半明半暗</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】中景&#10;【运镜】拉镜&#10;【动作】周维从口袋抽出旧担保复印件，高举过头顶，转身面向宾客。镜头从仰视中景向后拉，展现二十桌宾客齐刷刷投来的目光。&#10;【对话】周维：&quot;三十万借款，她签过字。现在翻脸就想不认？&quot;&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】担保复印件在灯光下泛着旧纸的黄，宾客席议论声如潮水涌起，周维站在舞台中央如审判者。&#10;【情绪】愤怒</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维：&quot;三十万借款，她签过字。现在翻脸就想不认？&quot;</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维从口袋抽出旧担保复印件，高举过头顶，转身面向宾客。镜头从仰视中景向后拉，展现二十桌宾客齐刷刷投来的目光。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">担保复印件在灯光下泛着旧纸的黄，宾客席议论声如潮水涌起，周维站在舞台中央如审判者。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">顶光从周维头顶直下形成强烈轮廓光，他面部半明半暗如双面人，宾客席隐入昏暗，氛围充满压迫与对峙</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台，周维站在舞台边缘面向二十桌宾客，手中举着泛黄的担保复印件，午间，舞台顶光从周维头顶打下，面部半明半暗，中景·仰拍·正面，周维从口袋抽出旧担保复印件，高举过头顶，转身面向宾客。镜头从仰视中景，愤怒，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo，首帧静止画面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">场景：婚宴厅主舞台，周维站在舞台边缘面向二十桌宾客，手中举着泛黄的担保复印件，午间，舞台顶光从周维头顶打下，面部半明半暗。镜头标题：举担保书。动作：周维从口袋抽出旧担保复印件，高举过头顶，转身面向宾客。镜头从仰视中景向后拉，展现二十桌宾客齐刷刷投来的目光。。对话：周维：&quot;三十万借款，她签过字。现在翻脸就想不认？&quot;。结果：担保复印件在灯光下泛着旧纸的黄，宾客席议论声如潮水涌起，周维站在舞台中央如审判者。。景别：中景。镜头角度：中景·仰拍·正面（medium shot (waist-up to full body), character and immediate surroundings visible, moderate depth of field, low-angle upward shot, camera below eye-line, slight upward tilt, empowering perspective, shooting from the front）。运镜：拉镜。氛围：顶光从周维头顶直下形成强烈轮廓光，他面部半明半暗如双面人，宾客席隐入昏暗，氛围充满压迫与对峙。情绪：愤怒。音效：周维声音高亢煽动，纸张抖动声，宾客议论声如蜂群嗡鸣。时长：7秒。风格：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo。=VideoRatio: 16:9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">10</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">10</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念回应</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第1幕·婚礼质问</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">8</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">近景</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">推镜</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅&#10;时间：午·内&#10;提示词：空无一人的酒店婚宴厅内部，午间自然光与宴会厅暖色灯光交织，二十桌圆形宴席整齐摆放，白色桌布、香槟色椅套、中央花艺、红金色婚礼布置，前方小型舞台和麦克风架，红色地毯通道，水晶吊灯，墙壁装饰喜字与纱幔，地面光洁反射灯光，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯场景背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内场景&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅，层高约六米，米金色软包墙面配红金婚礼布置；主材为抛光大理石地面、白色亚麻桌布、香槟色弹力椅套、水晶吊灯、纱幔与绒面地毯；二十桌圆形宴席分列中轴通道两侧，尽端为小型舞台与麦克风架，墙面悬挂喜字&#10;默认光线: 午间自然光由左侧落地窗斜入，与宴会厅暖色灯光（色温约3000K）交织，地面光洁形成大面积倒影与光斑&#10;气氛基调: 暖金与正红交织的喜庆色调，明亮通透，庄重而有仪式感&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;机位位于宴会厅后部入口处，视高约1.6米，地面平视广角镜头，横构图纳入整个大厅全貌：近景为最后排圆桌的白色桌布与香槟色椅背，中景为二十桌宴席沿中轴红色地毯通道对称纵深排开，远景为尽端小型舞台、麦克风架与喜字纱幔背景板。顶部成排水晶吊灯自前景延伸至舞台，左侧落地窗漏入的午间自然光在大理石地面拉出长条光带，与暖黄灯光在桌布上重叠。天花灯槽与墙面米金软包构成完整空间边界，整体色调暖金偏红，纵深感强烈。&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;机位移至中轴通道中段偏右，视高约1.4米，中景视角对准舞台前区与主通道交汇处——即迎宾与仪式展开的核心地带。红色地毯通道笔直通向舞台三级台阶，舞台台面深色木地板微微反光，中央矗立银色麦克风架，两侧摆放高身花艺与红金纱幔立柱。通道两侧最近的两桌圆宴清晰可见：白色桌布垂坠至地，香槟色椅套包裹椅背并系有金色蝴蝶结，桌面中央花艺、编号立牌与酒杯按位次排布。午间自然光斜落在舞台前沿与地毯上，与吊灯暖光在桌面形成冷暖交界的柔和光斑，地面倒影清晰。&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;特写镜头，机位贴近一桌宴席桌沿，视高约0.9米，浅景深虚化背景成排桌椅。画面主体为桌面陈设的材质与色彩层次：白色亚麻桌布细致织纹与自然垂褶，香槟色椅套的弹力布面与缎带光泽，中央花艺以白玫瑰、香槟玫瑰与红色果实相间插制，配暗金铜质花瓶；旁侧摆放高脚杯、骨质瓷餐具与红色喜糖盒，边缘露出红金桌卡与喜字纹样。侧逆的午间自然光在玻璃杯壁与银器上留下细亮高光，暖光则填亮花瓣暗部，质感细腻、明暗过渡柔和，集中呈现婚宴的正式与喜庆细节。&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位改为宴会厅左前侧二层回廊边缘，视高约3.2米，微俯斜角向下俯瞰全厅，与第1格机位高度和方向明确区别。画面呈对角线构图：近景为回廊栏杆与两侧墙面的喜字纱幔，中景为成排圆桌构成的白色弧形阵列与穿插其间的红色地毯通道，远景为舞台与背景板完整侧脸。顶部水晶吊灯由近及远层层排开，暖黄光点在地面大理石上连成倒影光带，左侧落地窗的午间自然光斜切整个大厅，勾出桌布与椅背的立体边缘。空间纵深、层高比例与建筑结构关系一目了然，光线、时段与天气与前三格完全一致。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新娘，也是周维的未婚妻。婚宴上她当众追问母亲住处，揭穿三十万借款和担保问题，最终摘下戒指宣布不结婚。她冷静独立，对母亲的偏袒感到痛苦，仍试图带母亲离开。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).&#10;&#10;周维&#10;外貌：男性，年龄约三十岁上下，身高约一米八，体型匀称偏壮，肩背宽厚。方脸，颧骨略高，浓眉，内双，眼神精明而带压迫感，鼻梁挺直，嘴唇偏厚，下颌线硬朗。黑色短发，鬓角修短，皮肤偏小麦色，下巴有细微胡茬。身穿深色西装，白衬衫，系深色领带，西装剪裁合体，袖口平整，手指粗壮，戴一枚男士婚戒。整体气质强势现实。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新郎，沈念的未婚夫。他向林秀兰借款三十万并转给妹妹，隐瞒担保，婚宴上公开旧担保复印件逼迫沈念。他强势现实，仍要搬空老房，是冲突的核心人物。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;男性，年龄约三十岁上下，身高约一米八，体型匀称偏壮，肩背宽厚。方脸，颧骨略高，浓眉，内双，眼神精明而带压迫感，鼻梁挺直，嘴唇偏厚，下颌线硬朗。黑色短发，鬓角修短，皮肤偏小麦色，下巴有细微胡茬。身穿深色西装，白衬衫，系深色领带，西装剪裁合体，袖口平整，手指粗壮，戴一枚男士婚戒。整体气质强势现实。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: male only — masculine build and facial features; do not feminize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台，沈念站在话筒架旁，周维持担保书站在她右侧两步外</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午间，舞台侧光从左侧打来，沈念右脸半明半暗</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】近景&#10;【运镜】推镜&#10;【动作】沈念直视周维，目光冷静如冰，嘴角没有一丝弧度。镜头从近景缓推至特写，背景周维举着纸的手虚化。&#10;【对话】沈念：&quot;我签过的会查清。不是你喊一声，我就替所有人认账。&quot;&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】沈念说完微微抬起下巴，目光如刀扫过周维，周维持纸的手僵在半空。&#10;【情绪】坚定</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念：&quot;我签过的会查清。不是你喊一声，我就替所有人认账。&quot;</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念直视周维，目光冷静如冰，嘴角没有一丝弧度。镜头从近景缓推至特写，背景周维举着纸的手虚化。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念说完微微抬起下巴，目光如刀扫过周维，周维持纸的手僵在半空。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">侧光在沈念面部形成锐利明暗分界，右眼在阴影中却格外明亮，氛围冷峻而坚定</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台，沈念站在话筒架旁，周维持担保书站在她右侧两步外，午间，舞台侧光从左侧打来，沈念右脸半明半暗，特写·平视·正面，沈念直视周维，目光冷静如冰，嘴角没有一丝弧度。镜头从近景缓推至特写，背景周维举着纸的手虚化，坚定，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo，首帧静止画面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">场景：婚宴厅主舞台，沈念站在话筒架旁，周维持担保书站在她右侧两步外，午间，舞台侧光从左侧打来，沈念右脸半明半暗。镜头标题：沈念回应。动作：沈念直视周维，目光冷静如冰，嘴角没有一丝弧度。镜头从近景缓推至特写，背景周维举着纸的手虚化。。对话：沈念：&quot;我签过的会查清。不是你喊一声，我就替所有人认账。&quot;。结果：沈念说完微微抬起下巴，目光如刀扫过周维，周维持纸的手僵在半空。。景别：近景。镜头角度：特写·平视·正面（close-up shot (face/bust framing), subject fills most of frame, shallow depth of field, background softly blurred, eye-level shot, neutral perspective, natural horizontal framing, shooting from the front）。运镜：推镜。氛围：侧光在沈念面部形成锐利明暗分界，右眼在阴影中却格外明亮，氛围冷峻而坚定。情绪：坚定。音效：沈念声音平静而锋利，每个字如冰珠落盘，宾客议论声被压下去。时长：8秒。风格：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo。=VideoRatio: 16:9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">11</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">11</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">母亲挡前</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第1幕·婚礼质问</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">5</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">中景</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">手持</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅&#10;时间：午·内&#10;提示词：空无一人的酒店婚宴厅内部，午间自然光与宴会厅暖色灯光交织，二十桌圆形宴席整齐摆放，白色桌布、香槟色椅套、中央花艺、红金色婚礼布置，前方小型舞台和麦克风架，红色地毯通道，水晶吊灯，墙壁装饰喜字与纱幔，地面光洁反射灯光，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯场景背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内场景&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅，层高约六米，米金色软包墙面配红金婚礼布置；主材为抛光大理石地面、白色亚麻桌布、香槟色弹力椅套、水晶吊灯、纱幔与绒面地毯；二十桌圆形宴席分列中轴通道两侧，尽端为小型舞台与麦克风架，墙面悬挂喜字&#10;默认光线: 午间自然光由左侧落地窗斜入，与宴会厅暖色灯光（色温约3000K）交织，地面光洁形成大面积倒影与光斑&#10;气氛基调: 暖金与正红交织的喜庆色调，明亮通透，庄重而有仪式感&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;机位位于宴会厅后部入口处，视高约1.6米，地面平视广角镜头，横构图纳入整个大厅全貌：近景为最后排圆桌的白色桌布与香槟色椅背，中景为二十桌宴席沿中轴红色地毯通道对称纵深排开，远景为尽端小型舞台、麦克风架与喜字纱幔背景板。顶部成排水晶吊灯自前景延伸至舞台，左侧落地窗漏入的午间自然光在大理石地面拉出长条光带，与暖黄灯光在桌布上重叠。天花灯槽与墙面米金软包构成完整空间边界，整体色调暖金偏红，纵深感强烈。&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;机位移至中轴通道中段偏右，视高约1.4米，中景视角对准舞台前区与主通道交汇处——即迎宾与仪式展开的核心地带。红色地毯通道笔直通向舞台三级台阶，舞台台面深色木地板微微反光，中央矗立银色麦克风架，两侧摆放高身花艺与红金纱幔立柱。通道两侧最近的两桌圆宴清晰可见：白色桌布垂坠至地，香槟色椅套包裹椅背并系有金色蝴蝶结，桌面中央花艺、编号立牌与酒杯按位次排布。午间自然光斜落在舞台前沿与地毯上，与吊灯暖光在桌面形成冷暖交界的柔和光斑，地面倒影清晰。&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;特写镜头，机位贴近一桌宴席桌沿，视高约0.9米，浅景深虚化背景成排桌椅。画面主体为桌面陈设的材质与色彩层次：白色亚麻桌布细致织纹与自然垂褶，香槟色椅套的弹力布面与缎带光泽，中央花艺以白玫瑰、香槟玫瑰与红色果实相间插制，配暗金铜质花瓶；旁侧摆放高脚杯、骨质瓷餐具与红色喜糖盒，边缘露出红金桌卡与喜字纹样。侧逆的午间自然光在玻璃杯壁与银器上留下细亮高光，暖光则填亮花瓣暗部，质感细腻、明暗过渡柔和，集中呈现婚宴的正式与喜庆细节。&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位改为宴会厅左前侧二层回廊边缘，视高约3.2米，微俯斜角向下俯瞰全厅，与第1格机位高度和方向明确区别。画面呈对角线构图：近景为回廊栏杆与两侧墙面的喜字纱幔，中景为成排圆桌构成的白色弧形阵列与穿插其间的红色地毯通道，远景为舞台与背景板完整侧脸。顶部水晶吊灯由近及远层层排开，暖黄光点在地面大理石上连成倒影光带，左侧落地窗的午间自然光斜切整个大厅，勾出桌布与椅背的立体边缘。空间纵深、层高比例与建筑结构关系一目了然，光线、时段与天气与前三格完全一致。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">林秀兰&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约五十六七岁，体型偏瘦，背略佝偻。圆脸，颧骨微凸，眼角与嘴角有细纹，眉色浅淡，眼神疲惫躲闪，鼻翼较宽，嘴唇干薄。头发花白掺杂，短卷发梳理整齐，皮肤暗黄，有老年斑和真实皮肤纹理。身穿暗紫红色针织开衫，内搭深色衬衫，下穿黑色长裤，手拿旧式手袋，手指关节明显。整体气质操劳隐忍。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：沈念的母亲。她卖掉老房支持女儿婚房，借款给周维并签协议，婚礼上试图维持局面，最后把老房钥匙交给周维。她偏袒周维，与女儿关系紧张。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约五十六七岁，体型偏瘦，背略佝偻。圆脸，颧骨微凸，眼角与嘴角有细纹，眉色浅淡，眼神疲惫躲闪，鼻翼较宽，嘴唇干薄。头发花白掺杂，短卷发梳理整齐，皮肤暗黄，有老年斑和真实皮肤纹理。身穿暗紫红色针织开衫，内搭深色衬衫，下穿黑色长裤，手拿旧式手袋，手指关节明显。整体气质操劳隐忍。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).&#10;&#10;沈念&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新娘，也是周维的未婚妻。婚宴上她当众追问母亲住处，揭穿三十万借款和担保问题，最终摘下戒指宣布不结婚。她冷静独立，对母亲的偏袒感到痛苦，仍试图带母亲离开。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台，林秀兰从宾客席冲上舞台，张开双臂挡在沈念面前</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午间，舞台灯光从上方洒下，林秀兰背对光源形成半剪影</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】中景&#10;【运镜】手持&#10;【动作】林秀兰从画面右侧冲入，张开双臂挡在沈念面前，背对宾客。镜头手持跟拍她冲上舞台的动作，画面有轻微晃动。&#10;【对话】林秀兰：&quot;先结婚，有什么回家说！&quot;&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】林秀兰站在沈念与宾客之间，后背微微弓起如护崽的母兽，沈念在她身后低头看着母亲的后背。&#10;【情绪】焦急</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">林秀兰：&quot;先结婚，有什么回家说！&quot;</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">林秀兰从画面右侧冲入，张开双臂挡在沈念面前，背对宾客。镜头手持跟拍她冲上舞台的动作，画面有轻微晃动。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">林秀兰站在沈念与宾客之间，后背微微弓起如护崽的母兽，沈念在她身后低头看着母亲的后背。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">顶光从林秀兰头顶洒下，她背对光源形成半剪影，面部在阴影中焦急而恳切，氛围紧张而心酸</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台，林秀兰从宾客席冲上舞台，张开双臂挡在沈念面前，午间，舞台灯光从上方洒下，林秀兰背对光源形成半剪影，中景·平视·正面，林秀兰从画面右侧冲入，张开双臂挡在沈念面前，背对宾客。镜头手持跟拍她冲上舞台的动作，画面有轻微晃动，焦急，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo，首帧静止画面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">场景：婚宴厅主舞台，林秀兰从宾客席冲上舞台，张开双臂挡在沈念面前，午间，舞台灯光从上方洒下，林秀兰背对光源形成半剪影。镜头标题：母亲挡前。动作：林秀兰从画面右侧冲入，张开双臂挡在沈念面前，背对宾客。镜头手持跟拍她冲上舞台的动作，画面有轻微晃动。。对话：林秀兰：&quot;先结婚，有什么回家说！&quot;。结果：林秀兰站在沈念与宾客之间，后背微微弓起如护崽的母兽，沈念在她身后低头看着母亲的后背。。景别：中景。镜头角度：中景·平视·正面（medium shot (waist-up to full body), character and immediate surroundings visible, moderate depth of field, eye-level shot, neutral perspective, natural horizontal framing, shooting from the front）。运镜：手持。氛围：顶光从林秀兰头顶洒下，她背对光源形成半剪影，面部在阴影中焦急而恳切，氛围紧张而心酸。情绪：焦急。音效：林秀兰声音尖锐急促，脚步急促踩在红毯上沉闷有声。时长：5秒。风格：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo。=VideoRatio: 16:9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">12</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">12</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">母女对视</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第1幕·婚礼质问</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">6</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">特写</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">推镜</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅&#10;时间：午·内&#10;提示词：空无一人的酒店婚宴厅内部，午间自然光与宴会厅暖色灯光交织，二十桌圆形宴席整齐摆放，白色桌布、香槟色椅套、中央花艺、红金色婚礼布置，前方小型舞台和麦克风架，红色地毯通道，水晶吊灯，墙壁装饰喜字与纱幔，地面光洁反射灯光，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯场景背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内场景&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅，层高约六米，米金色软包墙面配红金婚礼布置；主材为抛光大理石地面、白色亚麻桌布、香槟色弹力椅套、水晶吊灯、纱幔与绒面地毯；二十桌圆形宴席分列中轴通道两侧，尽端为小型舞台与麦克风架，墙面悬挂喜字&#10;默认光线: 午间自然光由左侧落地窗斜入，与宴会厅暖色灯光（色温约3000K）交织，地面光洁形成大面积倒影与光斑&#10;气氛基调: 暖金与正红交织的喜庆色调，明亮通透，庄重而有仪式感&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;机位位于宴会厅后部入口处，视高约1.6米，地面平视广角镜头，横构图纳入整个大厅全貌：近景为最后排圆桌的白色桌布与香槟色椅背，中景为二十桌宴席沿中轴红色地毯通道对称纵深排开，远景为尽端小型舞台、麦克风架与喜字纱幔背景板。顶部成排水晶吊灯自前景延伸至舞台，左侧落地窗漏入的午间自然光在大理石地面拉出长条光带，与暖黄灯光在桌布上重叠。天花灯槽与墙面米金软包构成完整空间边界，整体色调暖金偏红，纵深感强烈。&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;机位移至中轴通道中段偏右，视高约1.4米，中景视角对准舞台前区与主通道交汇处——即迎宾与仪式展开的核心地带。红色地毯通道笔直通向舞台三级台阶，舞台台面深色木地板微微反光，中央矗立银色麦克风架，两侧摆放高身花艺与红金纱幔立柱。通道两侧最近的两桌圆宴清晰可见：白色桌布垂坠至地，香槟色椅套包裹椅背并系有金色蝴蝶结，桌面中央花艺、编号立牌与酒杯按位次排布。午间自然光斜落在舞台前沿与地毯上，与吊灯暖光在桌面形成冷暖交界的柔和光斑，地面倒影清晰。&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;特写镜头，机位贴近一桌宴席桌沿，视高约0.9米，浅景深虚化背景成排桌椅。画面主体为桌面陈设的材质与色彩层次：白色亚麻桌布细致织纹与自然垂褶，香槟色椅套的弹力布面与缎带光泽，中央花艺以白玫瑰、香槟玫瑰与红色果实相间插制，配暗金铜质花瓶；旁侧摆放高脚杯、骨质瓷餐具与红色喜糖盒，边缘露出红金桌卡与喜字纹样。侧逆的午间自然光在玻璃杯壁与银器上留下细亮高光，暖光则填亮花瓣暗部，质感细腻、明暗过渡柔和，集中呈现婚宴的正式与喜庆细节。&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位改为宴会厅左前侧二层回廊边缘，视高约3.2米，微俯斜角向下俯瞰全厅，与第1格机位高度和方向明确区别。画面呈对角线构图：近景为回廊栏杆与两侧墙面的喜字纱幔，中景为成排圆桌构成的白色弧形阵列与穿插其间的红色地毯通道，远景为舞台与背景板完整侧脸。顶部水晶吊灯由近及远层层排开，暖黄光点在地面大理石上连成倒影光带，左侧落地窗的午间自然光斜切整个大厅，勾出桌布与椅背的立体边缘。空间纵深、层高比例与建筑结构关系一目了然，光线、时段与天气与前三格完全一致。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新娘，也是周维的未婚妻。婚宴上她当众追问母亲住处，揭穿三十万借款和担保问题，最终摘下戒指宣布不结婚。她冷静独立，对母亲的偏袒感到痛苦，仍试图带母亲离开。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).&#10;&#10;林秀兰&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约五十六七岁，体型偏瘦，背略佝偻。圆脸，颧骨微凸，眼角与嘴角有细纹，眉色浅淡，眼神疲惫躲闪，鼻翼较宽，嘴唇干薄。头发花白掺杂，短卷发梳理整齐，皮肤暗黄，有老年斑和真实皮肤纹理。身穿暗紫红色针织开衫，内搭深色衬衫，下穿黑色长裤，手拿旧式手袋，手指关节明显。整体气质操劳隐忍。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：沈念的母亲。她卖掉老房支持女儿婚房，借款给周维并签协议，婚礼上试图维持局面，最后把老房钥匙交给周维。她偏袒周维，与女儿关系紧张。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约五十六七岁，体型偏瘦，背略佝偻。圆脸，颧骨微凸，眼角与嘴角有细纹，眉色浅淡，眼神疲惫躲闪，鼻翼较宽，嘴唇干薄。头发花白掺杂，短卷发梳理整齐，皮肤暗黄，有老年斑和真实皮肤纹理。身穿暗紫红色针织开衫，内搭深色衬衫，下穿黑色长裤，手拿旧式手袋，手指关节明显。整体气质操劳隐忍。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台，沈念站在母亲身后，两人相距不到半步</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午间，舞台顶光在两人之间形成柔和过渡</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】特写&#10;【运镜】推镜&#10;【动作】沈念低头看着母亲拦在面前的背，目光从母亲肩头移向她的侧脸。镜头从特写缓推，两人面部占据画面，背景完全虚化。&#10;【对话】沈念：&quot;你怕我难看，还是怕他不娶我？&quot;&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】林秀兰嘴唇动了动，没有发出声音，目光躲闪看向地面。沈念眼中闪过一丝失望，睫毛轻颤。&#10;【情绪】心碎</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念：&quot;你怕我难看，还是怕他不娶我？&quot;</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念低头看着母亲拦在面前的背，目光从母亲肩头移向她的侧脸。镜头从特写缓推，两人面部占据画面，背景完全虚化。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">林秀兰嘴唇动了动，没有发出声音，目光躲闪看向地面。沈念眼中闪过一丝失望，睫毛轻颤。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">顶光柔化两人轮廓，林秀兰侧脸在阴影中显出细纹，沈念眼中映着母亲躲闪的目光，氛围心碎而安静</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅主舞台，沈念站在母亲身后，两人相距不到半步，午间，舞台顶光在两人之间形成柔和过渡，特写·平视·正面，沈念低头看着母亲拦在面前的背，目光从母亲肩头移向她的侧脸。镜头从特写缓推，两人面部占据画面，背景完全虚化，心碎，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo，首帧静止画面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">场景：婚宴厅主舞台，沈念站在母亲身后，两人相距不到半步，午间，舞台顶光在两人之间形成柔和过渡。镜头标题：母女对视。动作：沈念低头看着母亲拦在面前的背，目光从母亲肩头移向她的侧脸。镜头从特写缓推，两人面部占据画面，背景完全虚化。。对话：沈念：&quot;你怕我难看，还是怕他不娶我？&quot;。结果：林秀兰嘴唇动了动，没有发出声音，目光躲闪看向地面。沈念眼中闪过一丝失望，睫毛轻颤。。景别：特写。镜头角度：特写·平视·正面（close-up shot (face/bust framing), subject fills most of frame, shallow depth of field, background softly blurred, eye-level shot, neutral perspective, natural horizontal framing, shooting from the front）。运镜：推镜。氛围：顶光柔化两人轮廓，林秀兰侧脸在阴影中显出细纹，沈念眼中映着母亲躲闪的目光，氛围心碎而安静。情绪：心碎。音效：沈念声音轻而颤抖，几乎耳语，林秀兰嘴唇翕动无声，周围一片死寂。时长：6秒。风格：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo。=VideoRatio: 16:9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">13</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">13</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">找经理</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第2幕·宴席结算</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">5</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">中景</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">跟镜</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口&#10;时间：连续（午间至午后，室内外过渡）&#10;提示词：酒店婚宴厅出口及走廊过渡区域，连续时间、午间至午后，宴会厅双开门半开，门外是铺着地毯的酒店走廊，米色墙面、暖色壁灯、指示牌、签到台、绿植、远处电梯厅和玻璃门透入日光，门边可见婚宴告示架与结算台，地面整洁，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内（酒店室内，含室内外过渡区域）&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅出口及走廊过渡区域，米色墙面，暖色壁灯，地面铺设整洁地毯，宴会厅双开门半开，门外走廊延伸至电梯厅，远处玻璃门透入日光，设有签到台、绿植、指示牌、婚宴告示架与结算台&#10;默认光线: 自然光从远处玻璃门透入，室内暖色壁灯辅助照明，午间至午后，暖色调，光线柔和过渡&#10;气氛基调: 温馨喜庆，明亮优雅，暖色主导，空间通透&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;镜头高度: 人眼高度，地面平视，广角&#10;场景全貌: 宴会厅双开门半开，门外走廊延伸，米色墙面，暖色壁灯，指示牌，签到台，绿植，远处电梯厅和玻璃门透入日光，门边婚宴告示架与结算台，地面整洁地毯&#10;建筑轮廓: 现代酒店室内，天花有筒灯，墙面有装饰线条&#10;整体色调: 暖米色与淡金色，日光冷白与暖光交融&#10;展示完整空间边界&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;活动核心区: 宴会厅出口至签到台之间的过渡区域，地面地毯纹理，墙面壁灯，绿植，指示牌&#10;中景视角，光线落点: 玻璃门透入的日光在地面形成光斑，暖色壁灯照亮墙面&#10;功能: 宾客签到、停留、交谈的过渡空间&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;标志性元素: 签到台特写&#10;材质/纹理/色彩: 白色桌布，精致花艺，玻璃器皿，暖色灯光，背景虚化&#10;特写与景深: 浅景深，焦点在花艺与桌布细节&#10;指示意义: 婚宴签到与接待区域&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位高度与视角: 微俯，从走廊一端向宴会厅出口方向看&#10;保持相同光线/时段/天气&#10;展示空间纵深与建筑结构关系: 走廊纵深，双开门半开，光线从玻璃门透入，引导视线&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新娘，也是周维的未婚妻。婚宴上她当众追问母亲住处，揭穿三十万借款和担保问题，最终摘下戒指宣布不结婚。她冷静独立，对母亲的偏袒感到痛苦，仍试图带母亲离开。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).&#10;&#10;酒店经理&#10;外貌：成年酒店经理，酒店制服，持合同和结算单；制作设计待导演确定。&#10;描述：核算宴席费用并交付结清回执。Agent制作设计，原文未指定外貌。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">宴席合同与结算单&#10;类型：关键证物&#10;描述：酒店经理拿出的宴席合同与结算单，是婚宴出口场景中推动沈念经济困境的关键道具。合同为白色纸张，约A4大小，装订整齐，纸面有黑色打印条款与手写签名，结算单为稍窄的白色热敏纸或打印纸，列有明细数字，边缘平整。该道具在剧中直接呈现未开酒水退款、已上菜与约定费用扣除订金后仍差三万八千六的残酷现实，是沈念当场转账并发现余额骤降的触发物。&#10;提示词：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，一份白色宴席合同与一张白色结算单叠放在单一哑光纯色无缝棚拍背景上，画面中仅有这两份纸质文件一个主体，合同约A4大小，装订整齐，纸面有黑色打印条款与手写签名，结算单稍窄，列有明细数字，边缘平整，柔和均匀的棚拍光从上方照亮，无强烈反差阴影，无人物、手、家具、桌面、地面、室内外环境、散落杂物、其他道具、文字商标、包装、烟尘粒子，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口通道，一侧是宴会厅大门，另一侧通往酒店大堂，墙上挂着消防栓和指示牌</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午后，婚宴厅出口处光线由暖黄过渡到走廊冷白</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】中景&#10;【运镜】跟镜&#10;【动作】沈念提着裙摆快步穿过出口通道，找到站在服务台旁的酒店经理。经理从文件夹中抽出宴席合同和结算单。镜头跟拍沈念背影，她停下脚步转身面对经理。&#10;【对话】&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】经理将结算单递到沈念面前，手指点着上面的数字，沈念低头查看。&#10;【情绪】疲惫</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念提着裙摆快步穿过出口通道，找到站在服务台旁的酒店经理。经理从文件夹中抽出宴席合同和结算单。镜头跟拍沈念背影，她停下脚步转身面对经理。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">经理将结算单递到沈念面前，手指点着上面的数字，沈念低头查看。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">出口处光线从宴会厅暖黄过渡到走廊冷白，沈念白色婚纱在冷光下显得刺目，氛围从喧嚣转入冰冷的现实</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口通道，一侧是宴会厅大门，另一侧通往酒店大堂，墙上挂着消防栓和指示牌，午后，婚宴厅出口处光线由暖黄过渡到走廊冷白，中景·平视·正面，沈念提着裙摆快步穿过出口通道，找到站在服务台旁的酒店经理。经理从文件夹中抽出宴席合同和结算单。镜头跟拍沈念背影，她停下脚步转身面对经理，疲惫，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo，首帧静止画面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">场景：婚宴厅出口通道，一侧是宴会厅大门，另一侧通往酒店大堂，墙上挂着消防栓和指示牌，午后，婚宴厅出口处光线由暖黄过渡到走廊冷白。镜头标题：找经理。动作：沈念提着裙摆快步穿过出口通道，找到站在服务台旁的酒店经理。经理从文件夹中抽出宴席合同和结算单。镜头跟拍沈念背影，她停下脚步转身面对经理。。结果：经理将结算单递到沈念面前，手指点着上面的数字，沈念低头查看。。景别：中景。镜头角度：中景·平视·正面（medium shot (waist-up to full body), character and immediate surroundings visible, moderate depth of field, eye-level shot, neutral perspective, natural horizontal framing, shooting from the front）。运镜：跟镜。氛围：出口处光线从宴会厅暖黄过渡到走廊冷白，沈念白色婚纱在冷光下显得刺目，氛围从喧嚣转入冰冷的现实。情绪：疲惫。音效：脚步声急促踩在大理石地面，宴会厅内音乐声从身后传来逐渐减弱。时长：5秒。风格：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo。=VideoRatio: 16:9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">14</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">14</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">结算差额</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第2幕·宴席结算</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">10</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">特写</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">推镜</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口&#10;时间：连续（午间至午后，室内外过渡）&#10;提示词：酒店婚宴厅出口及走廊过渡区域，连续时间、午间至午后，宴会厅双开门半开，门外是铺着地毯的酒店走廊，米色墙面、暖色壁灯、指示牌、签到台、绿植、远处电梯厅和玻璃门透入日光，门边可见婚宴告示架与结算台，地面整洁，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内（酒店室内，含室内外过渡区域）&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅出口及走廊过渡区域，米色墙面，暖色壁灯，地面铺设整洁地毯，宴会厅双开门半开，门外走廊延伸至电梯厅，远处玻璃门透入日光，设有签到台、绿植、指示牌、婚宴告示架与结算台&#10;默认光线: 自然光从远处玻璃门透入，室内暖色壁灯辅助照明，午间至午后，暖色调，光线柔和过渡&#10;气氛基调: 温馨喜庆，明亮优雅，暖色主导，空间通透&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;镜头高度: 人眼高度，地面平视，广角&#10;场景全貌: 宴会厅双开门半开，门外走廊延伸，米色墙面，暖色壁灯，指示牌，签到台，绿植，远处电梯厅和玻璃门透入日光，门边婚宴告示架与结算台，地面整洁地毯&#10;建筑轮廓: 现代酒店室内，天花有筒灯，墙面有装饰线条&#10;整体色调: 暖米色与淡金色，日光冷白与暖光交融&#10;展示完整空间边界&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;活动核心区: 宴会厅出口至签到台之间的过渡区域，地面地毯纹理，墙面壁灯，绿植，指示牌&#10;中景视角，光线落点: 玻璃门透入的日光在地面形成光斑，暖色壁灯照亮墙面&#10;功能: 宾客签到、停留、交谈的过渡空间&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;标志性元素: 签到台特写&#10;材质/纹理/色彩: 白色桌布，精致花艺，玻璃器皿，暖色灯光，背景虚化&#10;特写与景深: 浅景深，焦点在花艺与桌布细节&#10;指示意义: 婚宴签到与接待区域&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位高度与视角: 微俯，从走廊一端向宴会厅出口方向看&#10;保持相同光线/时段/天气&#10;展示空间纵深与建筑结构关系: 走廊纵深，双开门半开，光线从玻璃门透入，引导视线&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新娘，也是周维的未婚妻。婚宴上她当众追问母亲住处，揭穿三十万借款和担保问题，最终摘下戒指宣布不结婚。她冷静独立，对母亲的偏袒感到痛苦，仍试图带母亲离开。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).&#10;&#10;酒店经理&#10;外貌：成年酒店经理，酒店制服，持合同和结算单；制作设计待导演确定。&#10;描述：核算宴席费用并交付结清回执。Agent制作设计，原文未指定外貌。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">宴席合同与结算单&#10;类型：关键证物&#10;描述：酒店经理拿出的宴席合同与结算单，是婚宴出口场景中推动沈念经济困境的关键道具。合同为白色纸张，约A4大小，装订整齐，纸面有黑色打印条款与手写签名，结算单为稍窄的白色热敏纸或打印纸，列有明细数字，边缘平整。该道具在剧中直接呈现未开酒水退款、已上菜与约定费用扣除订金后仍差三万八千六的残酷现实，是沈念当场转账并发现余额骤降的触发物。&#10;提示词：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，一份白色宴席合同与一张白色结算单叠放在单一哑光纯色无缝棚拍背景上，画面中仅有这两份纸质文件一个主体，合同约A4大小，装订整齐，纸面有黑色打印条款与手写签名，结算单稍窄，列有明细数字，边缘平整，柔和均匀的棚拍光从上方照亮，无强烈反差阴影，无人物、手、家具、桌面、地面、室内外环境、散落杂物、其他道具、文字商标、包装、烟尘粒子，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口通道服务台，白色大理石台面上放着结算单和计算器</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午后，走廊冷白顶光直射结算单</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】特写&#10;【运镜】推镜&#10;【动作】经理手指点在结算单上的数字处，镜头从俯视特写缓推，结算单上&quot;三万八千六&quot;被红笔圈出。&#10;【对话】经理：&quot;未开的酒水退掉。已上的菜和约定费用，扣完订金，还差三万八千六。&quot;&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】沈念的手伸入画面，拿起结算单，指尖微微发抖。&#10;【情绪】压力</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">经理：&quot;未开的酒水退掉。已上的菜和约定费用，扣完订金，还差三万八千六。&quot;</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">经理手指点在结算单上的数字处，镜头从俯视特写缓推，结算单上&quot;三万八千六&quot;被红笔圈出。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念的手伸入画面，拿起结算单，指尖微微发抖。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">冷白顶光直射纸面，数字如刀刻般清晰，走廊安静得能听见日光灯管的电流声</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口通道服务台，白色大理石台面上放着结算单和计算器，午后，走廊冷白顶光直射结算单，特写·俯拍·正面，经理手指点在结算单上的数字处，镜头从俯视特写缓推，结算单上&quot;三万八千六&quot;被红笔圈出，压力，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo，首帧静止画面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">场景：婚宴厅出口通道服务台，白色大理石台面上放着结算单和计算器，午后，走廊冷白顶光直射结算单。镜头标题：结算差额。动作：经理手指点在结算单上的数字处，镜头从俯视特写缓推，结算单上&quot;三万八千六&quot;被红笔圈出。。对话：经理：&quot;未开的酒水退掉。已上的菜和约定费用，扣完订金，还差三万八千六。&quot;。结果：沈念的手伸入画面，拿起结算单，指尖微微发抖。。景别：特写。镜头角度：特写·俯拍·正面（close-up shot (face/bust framing), subject fills most of frame, shallow depth of field, background softly blurred, high-angle bird's eye view, camera above looking down, background shows floor/ground with downward perspective distortion, shooting from the front）。运镜：推镜。氛围：冷白顶光直射纸面，数字如刀刻般清晰，走廊安静得能听见日光灯管的电流声。情绪：压力。音效：经理声音公事公办，计算器按键声，纸张翻动声。时长：10秒。风格：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo。=VideoRatio: 16:9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">15</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">15</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">余额仅剩1840</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第2幕·宴席结算</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">5</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">特写</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">推镜</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口&#10;时间：连续（午间至午后，室内外过渡）&#10;提示词：酒店婚宴厅出口及走廊过渡区域，连续时间、午间至午后，宴会厅双开门半开，门外是铺着地毯的酒店走廊，米色墙面、暖色壁灯、指示牌、签到台、绿植、远处电梯厅和玻璃门透入日光，门边可见婚宴告示架与结算台，地面整洁，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内（酒店室内，含室内外过渡区域）&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅出口及走廊过渡区域，米色墙面，暖色壁灯，地面铺设整洁地毯，宴会厅双开门半开，门外走廊延伸至电梯厅，远处玻璃门透入日光，设有签到台、绿植、指示牌、婚宴告示架与结算台&#10;默认光线: 自然光从远处玻璃门透入，室内暖色壁灯辅助照明，午间至午后，暖色调，光线柔和过渡&#10;气氛基调: 温馨喜庆，明亮优雅，暖色主导，空间通透&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;镜头高度: 人眼高度，地面平视，广角&#10;场景全貌: 宴会厅双开门半开，门外走廊延伸，米色墙面，暖色壁灯，指示牌，签到台，绿植，远处电梯厅和玻璃门透入日光，门边婚宴告示架与结算台，地面整洁地毯&#10;建筑轮廓: 现代酒店室内，天花有筒灯，墙面有装饰线条&#10;整体色调: 暖米色与淡金色，日光冷白与暖光交融&#10;展示完整空间边界&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;活动核心区: 宴会厅出口至签到台之间的过渡区域，地面地毯纹理，墙面壁灯，绿植，指示牌&#10;中景视角，光线落点: 玻璃门透入的日光在地面形成光斑，暖色壁灯照亮墙面&#10;功能: 宾客签到、停留、交谈的过渡空间&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;标志性元素: 签到台特写&#10;材质/纹理/色彩: 白色桌布，精致花艺，玻璃器皿，暖色灯光，背景虚化&#10;特写与景深: 浅景深，焦点在花艺与桌布细节&#10;指示意义: 婚宴签到与接待区域&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位高度与视角: 微俯，从走廊一端向宴会厅出口方向看&#10;保持相同光线/时段/天气&#10;展示空间纵深与建筑结构关系: 走廊纵深，双开门半开，光线从玻璃门透入，引导视线&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新娘，也是周维的未婚妻。婚宴上她当众追问母亲住处，揭穿三十万借款和担保问题，最终摘下戒指宣布不结婚。她冷静独立，对母亲的偏袒感到痛苦，仍试图带母亲离开。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口通道，沈念站在服务台前，手机屏幕亮着银行转账界面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午后，走廊冷白顶光在手机屏幕形成反光</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】特写&#10;【运镜】推镜&#10;【动作】沈念点开手机银行，镜头从俯视特写缓推，屏幕上余额数字从&quot;40440&quot;跳动变成&quot;1840&quot;。她的拇指悬在确认键上，然后按下。&#10;【对话】&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】转账成功页面弹出，沈念的手还在抖，手机屏幕映出她面无表情的脸。&#10;【情绪】麻木</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念点开银行转账，输入38600元，按下确认。转账成功后，余额从40440元变为1840元。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">转账成功，账户余额1840元。沈念握着手机，手仍在抖。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">手机屏幕冷光照亮沈念下半张脸，走廊顶灯在她头顶形成苍白光晕，氛围冰冷而残酷</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">手机转账画面：支付前余额40440元；沈念确认支付38600元；支付成功后余额1840元。不得在确认前显示扣款后的余额。静止首帧显示支付确认界面。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">手机转账画面：支付前余额40440元；沈念确认支付38600元；支付成功后余额1840元。不得在确认前显示扣款后的余额。按确认、显示成功、核对余额依次发生。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">16</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">16</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">结清回执</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第2幕·宴席结算</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">5</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">近景</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">推镜</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口&#10;时间：连续（午间至午后，室内外过渡）&#10;提示词：酒店婚宴厅出口及走廊过渡区域，连续时间、午间至午后，宴会厅双开门半开，门外是铺着地毯的酒店走廊，米色墙面、暖色壁灯、指示牌、签到台、绿植、远处电梯厅和玻璃门透入日光，门边可见婚宴告示架与结算台，地面整洁，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内（酒店室内，含室内外过渡区域）&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅出口及走廊过渡区域，米色墙面，暖色壁灯，地面铺设整洁地毯，宴会厅双开门半开，门外走廊延伸至电梯厅，远处玻璃门透入日光，设有签到台、绿植、指示牌、婚宴告示架与结算台&#10;默认光线: 自然光从远处玻璃门透入，室内暖色壁灯辅助照明，午间至午后，暖色调，光线柔和过渡&#10;气氛基调: 温馨喜庆，明亮优雅，暖色主导，空间通透&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;镜头高度: 人眼高度，地面平视，广角&#10;场景全貌: 宴会厅双开门半开，门外走廊延伸，米色墙面，暖色壁灯，指示牌，签到台，绿植，远处电梯厅和玻璃门透入日光，门边婚宴告示架与结算台，地面整洁地毯&#10;建筑轮廓: 现代酒店室内，天花有筒灯，墙面有装饰线条&#10;整体色调: 暖米色与淡金色，日光冷白与暖光交融&#10;展示完整空间边界&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;活动核心区: 宴会厅出口至签到台之间的过渡区域，地面地毯纹理，墙面壁灯，绿植，指示牌&#10;中景视角，光线落点: 玻璃门透入的日光在地面形成光斑，暖色壁灯照亮墙面&#10;功能: 宾客签到、停留、交谈的过渡空间&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;标志性元素: 签到台特写&#10;材质/纹理/色彩: 白色桌布，精致花艺，玻璃器皿，暖色灯光，背景虚化&#10;特写与景深: 浅景深，焦点在花艺与桌布细节&#10;指示意义: 婚宴签到与接待区域&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位高度与视角: 微俯，从走廊一端向宴会厅出口方向看&#10;保持相同光线/时段/天气&#10;展示空间纵深与建筑结构关系: 走廊纵深，双开门半开，光线从玻璃门透入，引导视线&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新娘，也是周维的未婚妻。婚宴上她当众追问母亲住处，揭穿三十万借款和担保问题，最终摘下戒指宣布不结婚。她冷静独立，对母亲的偏袒感到痛苦，仍试图带母亲离开。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).&#10;&#10;酒店经理&#10;外貌：成年酒店经理，酒店制服，持合同和结算单；制作设计待导演确定。&#10;描述：核算宴席费用并交付结清回执。Agent制作设计，原文未指定外貌。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">结清回执&#10;类型：关键证物&#10;描述：酒店经理在转账成功后交给沈念的宴席结清回执。证明宴席费用结清，不证明银行余额；1840元余额由手机画面呈现。&#10;提示词：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，一张白色结清回执放置在单一哑光纯色无缝棚拍背景上，画面中仅有这一张回执一个主体，尺寸较小，纸面有黑色打印文字与数字，边缘整齐，带有明显折痕和轻微褶皱，柔和均匀的棚拍光从上方照亮，无强烈反差阴影，无人物、手、家具、桌面、地面、室内外环境、散落杂物、其他道具、文字商标、包装、烟尘粒子，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口通道服务台，经理将结清回执递给沈念</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午后，走廊冷白灯光从侧面打来</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】近景&#10;【运镜】推镜&#10;【动作】经理将结清回执递过来，沈念接过折好放入手袋。镜头从近景缓推，她的手还在抖，折纸的动作重复了两次才折整齐。&#10;【对话】&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】回执被塞进手袋，沈念深吸一口气，转身看向宴会厅方向，母亲的身影在门口出现。&#10;【情绪】疲惫</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">经理将结清回执递过来，沈念接过折好放入手袋。镜头从近景缓推，她的手还在抖，折纸的动作重复了两次才折整齐。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">回执被塞进手袋，沈念深吸一口气，转身看向宴会厅方向，母亲的身影在门口出现。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">冷白灯光从侧面勾勒沈念轮廓，她白色婚纱在走廊里显得疲惫而沉重，氛围压抑而疲惫</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口通道服务台，经理将结清回执递给沈念，午后，走廊冷白灯光从侧面打来，特写·平视·正面，经理将结清回执递过来，沈念接过折好放入手袋。镜头从近景缓推，她的手还在抖，折纸的动作重复了两次才折整齐，疲惫，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo，首帧静止画面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">场景：婚宴厅出口通道服务台，经理将结清回执递给沈念，午后，走廊冷白灯光从侧面打来。镜头标题：结清回执。动作：经理将结清回执递过来，沈念接过折好放入手袋。镜头从近景缓推，她的手还在抖，折纸的动作重复了两次才折整齐。。结果：回执被塞进手袋，沈念深吸一口气，转身看向宴会厅方向，母亲的身影在门口出现。。景别：近景。镜头角度：特写·平视·正面（close-up shot (face/bust framing), subject fills most of frame, shallow depth of field, background softly blurred, eye-level shot, neutral perspective, natural horizontal framing, shooting from the front）。运镜：推镜。氛围：冷白灯光从侧面勾勒沈念轮廓，她白色婚纱在走廊里显得疲惫而沉重，氛围压抑而疲惫。情绪：疲惫。音效：纸张折叠声，沈念深呼吸声，远处宴会厅传来模糊人声。时长：5秒。风格：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo。=VideoRatio: 16:9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">17</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">17</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">拉母离开</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第2幕·宴席结算</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">7</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">中景</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">跟镜</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口&#10;时间：连续（午间至午后，室内外过渡）&#10;提示词：酒店婚宴厅出口及走廊过渡区域，连续时间、午间至午后，宴会厅双开门半开，门外是铺着地毯的酒店走廊，米色墙面、暖色壁灯、指示牌、签到台、绿植、远处电梯厅和玻璃门透入日光，门边可见婚宴告示架与结算台，地面整洁，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内（酒店室内，含室内外过渡区域）&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅出口及走廊过渡区域，米色墙面，暖色壁灯，地面铺设整洁地毯，宴会厅双开门半开，门外走廊延伸至电梯厅，远处玻璃门透入日光，设有签到台、绿植、指示牌、婚宴告示架与结算台&#10;默认光线: 自然光从远处玻璃门透入，室内暖色壁灯辅助照明，午间至午后，暖色调，光线柔和过渡&#10;气氛基调: 温馨喜庆，明亮优雅，暖色主导，空间通透&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;镜头高度: 人眼高度，地面平视，广角&#10;场景全貌: 宴会厅双开门半开，门外走廊延伸，米色墙面，暖色壁灯，指示牌，签到台，绿植，远处电梯厅和玻璃门透入日光，门边婚宴告示架与结算台，地面整洁地毯&#10;建筑轮廓: 现代酒店室内，天花有筒灯，墙面有装饰线条&#10;整体色调: 暖米色与淡金色，日光冷白与暖光交融&#10;展示完整空间边界&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;活动核心区: 宴会厅出口至签到台之间的过渡区域，地面地毯纹理，墙面壁灯，绿植，指示牌&#10;中景视角，光线落点: 玻璃门透入的日光在地面形成光斑，暖色壁灯照亮墙面&#10;功能: 宾客签到、停留、交谈的过渡空间&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;标志性元素: 签到台特写&#10;材质/纹理/色彩: 白色桌布，精致花艺，玻璃器皿，暖色灯光，背景虚化&#10;特写与景深: 浅景深，焦点在花艺与桌布细节&#10;指示意义: 婚宴签到与接待区域&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位高度与视角: 微俯，从走廊一端向宴会厅出口方向看&#10;保持相同光线/时段/天气&#10;展示空间纵深与建筑结构关系: 走廊纵深，双开门半开，光线从玻璃门透入，引导视线&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新娘，也是周维的未婚妻。婚宴上她当众追问母亲住处，揭穿三十万借款和担保问题，最终摘下戒指宣布不结婚。她冷静独立，对母亲的偏袒感到痛苦，仍试图带母亲离开。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).&#10;&#10;林秀兰&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约五十六七岁，体型偏瘦，背略佝偻。圆脸，颧骨微凸，眼角与嘴角有细纹，眉色浅淡，眼神疲惫躲闪，鼻翼较宽，嘴唇干薄。头发花白掺杂，短卷发梳理整齐，皮肤暗黄，有老年斑和真实皮肤纹理。身穿暗紫红色针织开衫，内搭深色衬衫，下穿黑色长裤，手拿旧式手袋，手指关节明显。整体气质操劳隐忍。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：沈念的母亲。她卖掉老房支持女儿婚房，借款给周维并签协议，婚礼上试图维持局面，最后把老房钥匙交给周维。她偏袒周维，与女儿关系紧张。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约五十六七岁，体型偏瘦，背略佝偻。圆脸，颧骨微凸，眼角与嘴角有细纹，眉色浅淡，眼神疲惫躲闪，鼻翼较宽，嘴唇干薄。头发花白掺杂，短卷发梳理整齐，皮肤暗黄，有老年斑和真实皮肤纹理。身穿暗紫红色针织开衫，内搭深色衬衫，下穿黑色长裤，手拿旧式手袋，手指关节明显。整体气质操劳隐忍。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口通道，林秀兰站在宴会厅门口，沈念从服务台方向走来拉住她的手臂</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午后，出口通道光线冷暖交界</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】中景&#10;【运镜】跟镜&#10;【动作】沈念快步走向母亲，拉住她的手臂往出口方向带。镜头跟拍两人，沈念边走边说话，林秀兰脚步迟疑。&#10;【对话】沈念：&quot;医院旁边的出租屋没退。妈，你先跟我住。&quot;&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】林秀兰被拉着走了两步，回头看向宴会厅内，脚步越来越慢。&#10;【情绪】急切</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念：&quot;医院旁边的出租屋没退。妈，你先跟我住。&quot;</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念快步走向母亲，拉住她的手臂往出口方向带。镜头跟拍两人，沈念边走边说话，林秀兰脚步迟疑。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">林秀兰被拉着走了两步，回头看向宴会厅内，脚步越来越慢。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">出口处光线冷暖交织，沈念白色婚纱在冷光中发亮，林秀兰深色衣服融入阴影，氛围急切而沉重</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口通道，林秀兰站在宴会厅门口，沈念从服务台方向走来拉住她的手臂，午后，出口通道光线冷暖交界，中景·平视·正面，沈念快步走向母亲，拉住她的手臂往出口方向带。镜头跟拍两人，沈念边走边说话，林秀兰脚步迟疑，急切，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo，首帧静止画面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">场景：婚宴厅出口通道，林秀兰站在宴会厅门口，沈念从服务台方向走来拉住她的手臂，午后，出口通道光线冷暖交界。镜头标题：拉母离开。动作：沈念快步走向母亲，拉住她的手臂往出口方向带。镜头跟拍两人，沈念边走边说话，林秀兰脚步迟疑。。对话：沈念：&quot;医院旁边的出租屋没退。妈，你先跟我住。&quot;。结果：林秀兰被拉着走了两步，回头看向宴会厅内，脚步越来越慢。。景别：中景。镜头角度：中景·平视·正面（medium shot (waist-up to full body), character and immediate surroundings visible, moderate depth of field, eye-level shot, neutral perspective, natural horizontal framing, shooting from the front）。运镜：跟镜。氛围：出口处光线冷暖交织，沈念白色婚纱在冷光中发亮，林秀兰深色衣服融入阴影，氛围急切而沉重。情绪：急切。音效：沈念声音急促而坚定，两人脚步声一快一慢，婚纱拖地摩擦声。时长：7秒。风格：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo。=VideoRatio: 16:9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">18</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">18</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维追出</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第2幕·宴席结算</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">7</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">中景</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">手持</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口&#10;时间：连续（午间至午后，室内外过渡）&#10;提示词：酒店婚宴厅出口及走廊过渡区域，连续时间、午间至午后，宴会厅双开门半开，门外是铺着地毯的酒店走廊，米色墙面、暖色壁灯、指示牌、签到台、绿植、远处电梯厅和玻璃门透入日光，门边可见婚宴告示架与结算台，地面整洁，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内（酒店室内，含室内外过渡区域）&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅出口及走廊过渡区域，米色墙面，暖色壁灯，地面铺设整洁地毯，宴会厅双开门半开，门外走廊延伸至电梯厅，远处玻璃门透入日光，设有签到台、绿植、指示牌、婚宴告示架与结算台&#10;默认光线: 自然光从远处玻璃门透入，室内暖色壁灯辅助照明，午间至午后，暖色调，光线柔和过渡&#10;气氛基调: 温馨喜庆，明亮优雅，暖色主导，空间通透&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;镜头高度: 人眼高度，地面平视，广角&#10;场景全貌: 宴会厅双开门半开，门外走廊延伸，米色墙面，暖色壁灯，指示牌，签到台，绿植，远处电梯厅和玻璃门透入日光，门边婚宴告示架与结算台，地面整洁地毯&#10;建筑轮廓: 现代酒店室内，天花有筒灯，墙面有装饰线条&#10;整体色调: 暖米色与淡金色，日光冷白与暖光交融&#10;展示完整空间边界&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;活动核心区: 宴会厅出口至签到台之间的过渡区域，地面地毯纹理，墙面壁灯，绿植，指示牌&#10;中景视角，光线落点: 玻璃门透入的日光在地面形成光斑，暖色壁灯照亮墙面&#10;功能: 宾客签到、停留、交谈的过渡空间&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;标志性元素: 签到台特写&#10;材质/纹理/色彩: 白色桌布，精致花艺，玻璃器皿，暖色灯光，背景虚化&#10;特写与景深: 浅景深，焦点在花艺与桌布细节&#10;指示意义: 婚宴签到与接待区域&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位高度与视角: 微俯，从走廊一端向宴会厅出口方向看&#10;保持相同光线/时段/天气&#10;展示空间纵深与建筑结构关系: 走廊纵深，双开门半开，光线从玻璃门透入，引导视线&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维&#10;外貌：男性，年龄约三十岁上下，身高约一米八，体型匀称偏壮，肩背宽厚。方脸，颧骨略高，浓眉，内双，眼神精明而带压迫感，鼻梁挺直，嘴唇偏厚，下颌线硬朗。黑色短发，鬓角修短，皮肤偏小麦色，下巴有细微胡茬。身穿深色西装，白衬衫，系深色领带，西装剪裁合体，袖口平整，手指粗壮，戴一枚男士婚戒。整体气质强势现实。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新郎，沈念的未婚夫。他向林秀兰借款三十万并转给妹妹，隐瞒担保，婚宴上公开旧担保复印件逼迫沈念。他强势现实，仍要搬空老房，是冲突的核心人物。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;男性，年龄约三十岁上下，身高约一米八，体型匀称偏壮，肩背宽厚。方脸，颧骨略高，浓眉，内双，眼神精明而带压迫感，鼻梁挺直，嘴唇偏厚，下颌线硬朗。黑色短发，鬓角修短，皮肤偏小麦色，下巴有细微胡茬。身穿深色西装，白衬衫，系深色领带，西装剪裁合体，袖口平整，手指粗壮，戴一枚男士婚戒。整体气质强势现实。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: male only — masculine build and facial features; do not feminize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).&#10;&#10;沈念&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新娘，也是周维的未婚妻。婚宴上她当众追问母亲住处，揭穿三十万借款和担保问题，最终摘下戒指宣布不结婚。她冷静独立，对母亲的偏袒感到痛苦，仍试图带母亲离开。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).&#10;&#10;林秀兰&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约五十六七岁，体型偏瘦，背略佝偻。圆脸，颧骨微凸，眼角与嘴角有细纹，眉色浅淡，眼神疲惫躲闪，鼻翼较宽，嘴唇干薄。头发花白掺杂，短卷发梳理整齐，皮肤暗黄，有老年斑和真实皮肤纹理。身穿暗紫红色针织开衫，内搭深色衬衫，下穿黑色长裤，手拿旧式手袋，手指关节明显。整体气质操劳隐忍。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：沈念的母亲。她卖掉老房支持女儿婚房，借款给周维并签协议，婚礼上试图维持局面，最后把老房钥匙交给周维。她偏袒周维，与女儿关系紧张。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约五十六七岁，体型偏瘦，背略佝偻。圆脸，颧骨微凸，眼角与嘴角有细纹，眉色浅淡，眼神疲惫躲闪，鼻翼较宽，嘴唇干薄。头发花白掺杂，短卷发梳理整齐，皮肤暗黄，有老年斑和真实皮肤纹理。身穿暗紫红色针织开衫，内搭深色衬衫，下穿黑色长裤，手拿旧式手袋，手指关节明显。整体气质操劳隐忍。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口通道，周维从宴会厅追出来，站在沈念和林秀兰身后三步远</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午后，走廊光线从宴会厅暖光过渡到出口冷白</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】中景&#10;【运镜】手持&#10;【动作】周维从宴会厅追出，西装外套敞开，领带歪斜。他站在通道中间，声音从身后传来。镜头手持跟拍他追出的动作，画面有轻微晃动。&#10;【对话】周维：&quot;你让妈挤那个单间？婚房本来给她留了卧室！&quot;&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】沈念停下脚步但没有回头，林秀兰从她手中抽出手臂，转身面对周维。&#10;【情绪】讽刺</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维：&quot;你让妈挤那个单间？婚房本来给她留了卧室！&quot;</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维从宴会厅追出，西装外套敞开，领带歪斜。他站在通道中间，声音从身后传来。镜头手持跟拍他追出的动作，画面有轻微晃动。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念停下脚步但没有回头，林秀兰从她手中抽出手臂，转身面对周维。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">走廊顶灯在周维头顶形成苍白光晕，他站在冷暖交界处，面部一半暖光一半冷光，氛围撕裂而讽刺</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口通道，周维从宴会厅追出来，站在沈念和林秀兰身后三步远，午后，走廊光线从宴会厅暖光过渡到出口冷白，中景·平视·正面，周维从宴会厅追出，西装外套敞开，领带歪斜。他站在通道中间，声音从身后传来。镜头手持跟拍他追出的动作，画面有轻微晃动，讽刺，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo，首帧静止画面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">场景：婚宴厅出口通道，周维从宴会厅追出来，站在沈念和林秀兰身后三步远，午后，走廊光线从宴会厅暖光过渡到出口冷白。镜头标题：周维追出。动作：周维从宴会厅追出，西装外套敞开，领带歪斜。他站在通道中间，声音从身后传来。镜头手持跟拍他追出的动作，画面有轻微晃动。。对话：周维：&quot;你让妈挤那个单间？婚房本来给她留了卧室！&quot;。结果：沈念停下脚步但没有回头，林秀兰从她手中抽出手臂，转身面对周维。。景别：中景。镜头角度：中景·平视·正面（medium shot (waist-up to full body), character and immediate surroundings visible, moderate depth of field, eye-level shot, neutral perspective, natural horizontal framing, shooting from the front）。运镜：手持。氛围：走廊顶灯在周维头顶形成苍白光晕，他站在冷暖交界处，面部一半暖光一半冷光，氛围撕裂而讽刺。情绪：讽刺。音效：周维声音高亢带着表演性质的委屈，皮鞋急促敲击地面。时长：7秒。风格：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo。=VideoRatio: 16:9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">19</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">19</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">钥匙易手</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第2幕·宴席结算</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">特写</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">推镜</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口&#10;时间：连续（午间至午后，室内外过渡）&#10;提示词：酒店婚宴厅出口及走廊过渡区域，连续时间、午间至午后，宴会厅双开门半开，门外是铺着地毯的酒店走廊，米色墙面、暖色壁灯、指示牌、签到台、绿植、远处电梯厅和玻璃门透入日光，门边可见婚宴告示架与结算台，地面整洁，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内（酒店室内，含室内外过渡区域）&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅出口及走廊过渡区域，米色墙面，暖色壁灯，地面铺设整洁地毯，宴会厅双开门半开，门外走廊延伸至电梯厅，远处玻璃门透入日光，设有签到台、绿植、指示牌、婚宴告示架与结算台&#10;默认光线: 自然光从远处玻璃门透入，室内暖色壁灯辅助照明，午间至午后，暖色调，光线柔和过渡&#10;气氛基调: 温馨喜庆，明亮优雅，暖色主导，空间通透&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;镜头高度: 人眼高度，地面平视，广角&#10;场景全貌: 宴会厅双开门半开，门外走廊延伸，米色墙面，暖色壁灯，指示牌，签到台，绿植，远处电梯厅和玻璃门透入日光，门边婚宴告示架与结算台，地面整洁地毯&#10;建筑轮廓: 现代酒店室内，天花有筒灯，墙面有装饰线条&#10;整体色调: 暖米色与淡金色，日光冷白与暖光交融&#10;展示完整空间边界&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;活动核心区: 宴会厅出口至签到台之间的过渡区域，地面地毯纹理，墙面壁灯，绿植，指示牌&#10;中景视角，光线落点: 玻璃门透入的日光在地面形成光斑，暖色壁灯照亮墙面&#10;功能: 宾客签到、停留、交谈的过渡空间&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;标志性元素: 签到台特写&#10;材质/纹理/色彩: 白色桌布，精致花艺，玻璃器皿，暖色灯光，背景虚化&#10;特写与景深: 浅景深，焦点在花艺与桌布细节&#10;指示意义: 婚宴签到与接待区域&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位高度与视角: 微俯，从走廊一端向宴会厅出口方向看&#10;保持相同光线/时段/天气&#10;展示空间纵深与建筑结构关系: 走廊纵深，双开门半开，光线从玻璃门透入，引导视线&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">林秀兰&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约五十六七岁，体型偏瘦，背略佝偻。圆脸，颧骨微凸，眼角与嘴角有细纹，眉色浅淡，眼神疲惫躲闪，鼻翼较宽，嘴唇干薄。头发花白掺杂，短卷发梳理整齐，皮肤暗黄，有老年斑和真实皮肤纹理。身穿暗紫红色针织开衫，内搭深色衬衫，下穿黑色长裤，手拿旧式手袋，手指关节明显。整体气质操劳隐忍。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：沈念的母亲。她卖掉老房支持女儿婚房，借款给周维并签协议，婚礼上试图维持局面，最后把老房钥匙交给周维。她偏袒周维，与女儿关系紧张。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约五十六七岁，体型偏瘦，背略佝偻。圆脸，颧骨微凸，眼角与嘴角有细纹，眉色浅淡，眼神疲惫躲闪，鼻翼较宽，嘴唇干薄。头发花白掺杂，短卷发梳理整齐，皮肤暗黄，有老年斑和真实皮肤纹理。身穿暗紫红色针织开衫，内搭深色衬衫，下穿黑色长裤，手拿旧式手袋，手指关节明显。整体气质操劳隐忍。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).&#10;&#10;周维&#10;外貌：男性，年龄约三十岁上下，身高约一米八，体型匀称偏壮，肩背宽厚。方脸，颧骨略高，浓眉，内双，眼神精明而带压迫感，鼻梁挺直，嘴唇偏厚，下颌线硬朗。黑色短发，鬓角修短，皮肤偏小麦色，下巴有细微胡茬。身穿深色西装，白衬衫，系深色领带，西装剪裁合体，袖口平整，手指粗壮，戴一枚男士婚戒。整体气质强势现实。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新郎，沈念的未婚夫。他向林秀兰借款三十万并转给妹妹，隐瞒担保，婚宴上公开旧担保复印件逼迫沈念。他强势现实，仍要搬空老房，是冲突的核心人物。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;男性，年龄约三十岁上下，身高约一米八，体型匀称偏壮，肩背宽厚。方脸，颧骨略高，浓眉，内双，眼神精明而带压迫感，鼻梁挺直，嘴唇偏厚，下颌线硬朗。黑色短发，鬓角修短，皮肤偏小麦色，下巴有细微胡茬。身穿深色西装，白衬衫，系深色领带，西装剪裁合体，袖口平整，手指粗壮，戴一枚男士婚戒。整体气质强势现实。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: male only — masculine build and facial features; do not feminize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).&#10;&#10;沈念&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新娘，也是周维的未婚妻。婚宴上她当众追问母亲住处，揭穿三十万借款和担保问题，最终摘下戒指宣布不结婚。她冷静独立，对母亲的偏袒感到痛苦，仍试图带母亲离开。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">老房钥匙&#10;类型：关键证物&#10;描述：林秀兰从手袋中取出并递给周维的老房钥匙，是母女关系与家庭归属发生转移的关键道具。钥匙为常见金属材质，表面有使用多年的磨损痕迹和轻微氧化，齿纹清晰，串在一个简单金属圆环上，可能附带一两把备用钥匙，整体沉甸甸有真实体量感。该道具在剧中象征林秀兰对老房的处置权与对周维的信任，钥匙离开母亲手心的一刻，直接刺痛沈念并推动她跑向门口。&#10;提示词：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，一串金属老房钥匙放置在单一哑光纯色无缝棚拍背景上，画面中仅有这一串钥匙一个主体，钥匙表面有使用多年的磨损痕迹和轻微氧化，齿纹清晰，串在简单金属圆环上，附带一两把备用钥匙，整体有真实体量感，柔和均匀的棚拍光从上方照亮，无强烈反差阴影，无人物、手、家具、桌面、地面、室内外环境、散落杂物、其他道具、文字商标、包装、烟尘粒子，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口通道，林秀兰站在沈念与周维之间，手中握着老房钥匙</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午后，走廊冷白顶光聚焦手部</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】特写&#10;【运镜】推镜&#10;【动作】林秀兰抽开女儿的手，从手袋里摸出老房钥匙，递向周维。镜头从俯视特写缓推，钥匙在冷光下泛着铜色，从母亲手心交到周维手心。&#10;【对话】林秀兰：&quot;维维，帮我把东西搬过去。念念今天气头上，过两天就好了。&quot;&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】钥匙落入周维掌心，他合拢手指握住。沈念站在几步外，看着钥匙离开母亲手心的全过程，眼中最后一点光熄灭。&#10;【情绪】绝望</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">林秀兰：&quot;维维，帮我把东西搬过去。念念今天气头上，过两天就好了。&quot;</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">林秀兰从手袋取出老房钥匙递给周维，钥匙从母亲手心交到周维手心。不重复表演上一镜已发生的抽开女儿手臂。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">钥匙落入周维掌心，他合拢手指握住。沈念站在几步外，看着钥匙离开母亲手心的全过程，眼中最后一点光熄灭。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">冷白顶光聚焦在交接钥匙的手上，周围环境压暗，铜钥匙在冷光中泛着旧色，氛围如坠冰窖</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口通道，林秀兰站在沈念与周维之间，手中握着老房钥匙，午后，走廊冷白顶光聚焦手部，特写·俯拍·正面，林秀兰从手袋里摸出老房钥匙，递向周维。镜头从俯视特写缓推，钥匙在冷光下泛着铜色，从母亲手心交到周维手心，绝望，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo，首帧静止画面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">场景：婚宴厅出口通道，林秀兰站在沈念与周维之间，手中握着老房钥匙，午后，走廊冷白顶光聚焦手部。镜头标题：钥匙易手。动作：林秀兰从手袋里摸出老房钥匙，递向周维。镜头从俯视特写缓推，钥匙在冷光下泛着铜色，从母亲手心交到周维手心。。对话：林秀兰：&quot;维维，帮我把东西搬过去。念念今天气头上，过两天就好了。&quot;。结果：钥匙落入周维掌心，他合拢手指握住。沈念站在几步外，看着钥匙离开母亲手心的全过程，眼中最后一点光熄灭。。景别：特写。镜头角度：特写·俯拍·正面（close-up shot (face/bust framing), subject fills most of frame, shallow depth of field, background softly blurred, high-angle bird's eye view, camera above looking down, background shows floor/ground with downward perspective distortion, shooting from the front）。运镜：推镜。氛围：冷白顶光聚焦在交接钥匙的手上，周围环境压暗，铜钥匙在冷光中泛着旧色，氛围如坠冰窖。情绪：绝望。音效：钥匙金属碰撞声清脆刺耳，林秀兰声音疲惫而讨好，沈念呼吸声停了一拍。时长：9秒。风格：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo。=VideoRatio: 16:9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">20</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">20</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">搬空旧物</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第2幕·宴席结算</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">15</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">中景</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">横摇</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口&#10;时间：连续（午间至午后，室内外过渡）&#10;提示词：酒店婚宴厅出口及走廊过渡区域，连续时间、午间至午后，宴会厅双开门半开，门外是铺着地毯的酒店走廊，米色墙面、暖色壁灯、指示牌、签到台、绿植、远处电梯厅和玻璃门透入日光，门边可见婚宴告示架与结算台，地面整洁，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内（酒店室内，含室内外过渡区域）&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅出口及走廊过渡区域，米色墙面，暖色壁灯，地面铺设整洁地毯，宴会厅双开门半开，门外走廊延伸至电梯厅，远处玻璃门透入日光，设有签到台、绿植、指示牌、婚宴告示架与结算台&#10;默认光线: 自然光从远处玻璃门透入，室内暖色壁灯辅助照明，午间至午后，暖色调，光线柔和过渡&#10;气氛基调: 温馨喜庆，明亮优雅，暖色主导，空间通透&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;镜头高度: 人眼高度，地面平视，广角&#10;场景全貌: 宴会厅双开门半开，门外走廊延伸，米色墙面，暖色壁灯，指示牌，签到台，绿植，远处电梯厅和玻璃门透入日光，门边婚宴告示架与结算台，地面整洁地毯&#10;建筑轮廓: 现代酒店室内，天花有筒灯，墙面有装饰线条&#10;整体色调: 暖米色与淡金色，日光冷白与暖光交融&#10;展示完整空间边界&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;活动核心区: 宴会厅出口至签到台之间的过渡区域，地面地毯纹理，墙面壁灯，绿植，指示牌&#10;中景视角，光线落点: 玻璃门透入的日光在地面形成光斑，暖色壁灯照亮墙面&#10;功能: 宾客签到、停留、交谈的过渡空间&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;标志性元素: 签到台特写&#10;材质/纹理/色彩: 白色桌布，精致花艺，玻璃器皿，暖色灯光，背景虚化&#10;特写与景深: 浅景深，焦点在花艺与桌布细节&#10;指示意义: 婚宴签到与接待区域&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位高度与视角: 微俯，从走廊一端向宴会厅出口方向看&#10;保持相同光线/时段/天气&#10;展示空间纵深与建筑结构关系: 走廊纵深，双开门半开，光线从玻璃门透入，引导视线&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维&#10;外貌：男性，年龄约三十岁上下，身高约一米八，体型匀称偏壮，肩背宽厚。方脸，颧骨略高，浓眉，内双，眼神精明而带压迫感，鼻梁挺直，嘴唇偏厚，下颌线硬朗。黑色短发，鬓角修短，皮肤偏小麦色，下巴有细微胡茬。身穿深色西装，白衬衫，系深色领带，西装剪裁合体，袖口平整，手指粗壮，戴一枚男士婚戒。整体气质强势现实。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新郎，沈念的未婚夫。他向林秀兰借款三十万并转给妹妹，隐瞒担保，婚宴上公开旧担保复印件逼迫沈念。他强势现实，仍要搬空老房，是冲突的核心人物。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;男性，年龄约三十岁上下，身高约一米八，体型匀称偏壮，肩背宽厚。方脸，颧骨略高，浓眉，内双，眼神精明而带压迫感，鼻梁挺直，嘴唇偏厚，下颌线硬朗。黑色短发，鬓角修短，皮肤偏小麦色，下巴有细微胡茬。身穿深色西装，白衬衫，系深色领带，西装剪裁合体，袖口平整，手指粗壮，戴一枚男士婚戒。整体气质强势现实。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: male only — masculine build and facial features; do not feminize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).&#10;&#10;沈念&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新娘，也是周维的未婚妻。婚宴上她当众追问母亲住处，揭穿三十万借款和担保问题，最终摘下戒指宣布不结婚。她冷静独立，对母亲的偏袒感到痛苦，仍试图带母亲离开。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口通道，周维站在门口对着手机发语音，沈念在画面边缘</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午后，走廊光线偏冷，周维面部半明半暗</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】中景&#10;【运镜】横摇&#10;【动作】周维对着手机发语音，嘴角带着得逞的笑。沈念从画面边缘抬头，目光如刀。镜头从周维横摇到沈念，再摇回周维。&#10;【对话】周维：&quot;老房现在清。工具、破凳子，那些旧东西都不要。&quot; 沈念：&quot;你答应给她搬家，不是替她扔东西！&quot; 周维：&quot;你不嫁了，还管我家放什么？&quot;&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】周维说完收起手机，挑衅地看着沈念。沈念提起裙摆，转身跑向出口。&#10;【情绪】愤怒</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维：&quot;老房现在清。工具、破凳子，那些旧东西都不要。&quot; 沈念：&quot;你答应给她搬家，不是替她扔东西！&quot; 周维：&quot;你不嫁了，还管我家放什么？&quot;</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维对着手机发语音，嘴角带着得逞的笑。沈念从画面边缘抬头，目光如刀。镜头从周维横摇到沈念，再摇回周维。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">周维说完收起手机，挑衅地看着沈念。沈念提起裙摆，转身跑向出口。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">走廊冷光从上方压下，周维面部在阴影中显出冷漠，沈念白色婚纱在奔跑中如一道光，氛围愤怒而悲凉</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口通道，周维站在门口对着手机发语音，沈念在画面边缘，午后，走廊光线偏冷，周维面部半明半暗，中景·平视·正面，周维对着手机发语音，嘴角带着得逞的笑。沈念从画面边缘抬头，目光如刀。镜头从周维横摇到沈念，再摇回周维，愤怒，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo，首帧静止画面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">场景：婚宴厅出口通道，周维站在门口对着手机发语音，沈念在画面边缘，午后，走廊光线偏冷，周维面部半明半暗。镜头标题：搬空旧物。动作：周维对着手机发语音，嘴角带着得逞的笑。沈念从画面边缘抬头，目光如刀。镜头从周维横摇到沈念，再摇回周维。。对话：周维：&quot;老房现在清。工具、破凳子，那些旧东西都不要。&quot; 沈念：&quot;你答应给她搬家，不是替她扔东西！&quot; 周维：&quot;你不嫁了，还管我家放什么？&quot;。结果：周维说完收起手机，挑衅地看着沈念。沈念提起裙摆，转身跑向出口。。景别：中景。镜头角度：中景·平视·正面（medium shot (waist-up to full body), character and immediate surroundings visible, moderate depth of field, eye-level shot, neutral perspective, natural horizontal framing, shooting from the front）。运镜：横摇。氛围：走廊冷光从上方压下，周维面部在阴影中显出冷漠，沈念白色婚纱在奔跑中如一道光，氛围愤怒而悲凉。情绪：愤怒。音效：周维语音发送提示音，沈念声音尖锐愤怒，婚纱拖地急促摩擦声。时长：15秒。风格：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo。=VideoRatio: 16:9</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">21</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">21</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">跑向门口</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">第2幕·宴席结算</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">7</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">远景</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">跟镜</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">婚宴厅出口&#10;时间：连续（午间至午后，室内外过渡）&#10;提示词：酒店婚宴厅出口及走廊过渡区域，连续时间、午间至午后，宴会厅双开门半开，门外是铺着地毯的酒店走廊，米色墙面、暖色壁灯、指示牌、签到台、绿植、远处电梯厅和玻璃门透入日光，门边可见婚宴告示架与结算台，地面整洁，画面中没有任何人物、角色、人影或身体部位，纯背景，无动作，无文字水印。16:9 横构图，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;润色：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo&#10;&#10;Scene environment reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image: 2×2 grid. TL=establishing wide (full space, boundaries, context). TR=main activity zone medium shot (floor, key furnishings). BL=signature environmental detail close-up. BR=alternate angle view (same place, same lighting/time/weather, different camera angle such as elevated/low/high/oblique).&#10;&#10;No people: no characters, silhouettes, human shadows. No text/labels/watermarks/location lettering. Same architecture, terrain, ground materials, and key props across all panels; same light, time, and weather; only focal length and camera angle may change. Unified palette and depth; high detail. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 block at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;【场景基础设定】&#10;场景类型: 室内（酒店室内，含室内外过渡区域）&#10;地点特征: 现代酒店婚宴厅出口及走廊过渡区域，米色墙面，暖色壁灯，地面铺设整洁地毯，宴会厅双开门半开，门外走廊延伸至电梯厅，远处玻璃门透入日光，设有签到台、绿植、指示牌、婚宴告示架与结算台&#10;默认光线: 自然光从远处玻璃门透入，室内暖色壁灯辅助照明，午间至午后，暖色调，光线柔和过渡&#10;气氛基调: 温馨喜庆，明亮优雅，暖色主导，空间通透&#10;&#10;【第1格-全景建立镜头】&#10;镜头高度: 人眼高度，地面平视，广角&#10;场景全貌: 宴会厅双开门半开，门外走廊延伸，米色墙面，暖色壁灯，指示牌，签到台，绿植，远处电梯厅和玻璃门透入日光，门边婚宴告示架与结算台，地面整洁地毯&#10;建筑轮廓: 现代酒店室内，天花有筒灯，墙面有装饰线条&#10;整体色调: 暖米色与淡金色，日光冷白与暖光交融&#10;展示完整空间边界&#10;&#10;【第2格-主体焦点区域】&#10;活动核心区: 宴会厅出口至签到台之间的过渡区域，地面地毯纹理，墙面壁灯，绿植，指示牌&#10;中景视角，光线落点: 玻璃门透入的日光在地面形成光斑，暖色壁灯照亮墙面&#10;功能: 宾客签到、停留、交谈的过渡空间&#10;&#10;【第3格-环境特征细节】&#10;标志性元素: 签到台特写&#10;材质/纹理/色彩: 白色桌布，精致花艺，玻璃器皿，暖色灯光，背景虚化&#10;特写与景深: 浅景深，焦点在花艺与桌布细节&#10;指示意义: 婚宴签到与接待区域&#10;&#10;【第4格-角度变体】&#10;机位高度与视角: 微俯，从走廊一端向宴会厅出口方向看&#10;保持相同光线/时段/天气&#10;展示空间纵深与建筑结构关系: 走廊纵深，双开门半开，光线从玻璃门透入，引导视线&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo). No people, no text.</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念&#10;外貌：女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新娘，也是周维的未婚妻。婚宴上她当众追问母亲住处，揭穿三十万借款和担保问题，最终摘下戒指宣布不结婚。她冷静独立，对母亲的偏袒感到痛苦，仍试图带母亲离开。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约二十八九岁，身材纤细高挑，肩颈线条清晰。鹅蛋脸，眉形利落，眼型偏长，眼神冷静克制，鼻梁挺直，唇形偏薄。皮肤白皙，可见真实毛孔与细微纹理。黑色长直发盘成低髻，发丝整齐，佩戴简约珍珠耳饰。身穿白色抹胸婚纱，缎面与薄纱拼接，立体剪裁，裙摆有自然褶皱，手部纤细，指甲整洁。整体气质清冷倔强。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).&#10;&#10;周维&#10;外貌：男性，年龄约三十岁上下，身高约一米八，体型匀称偏壮，肩背宽厚。方脸，颧骨略高，浓眉，内双，眼神精明而带压迫感，鼻梁挺直，嘴唇偏厚，下颌线硬朗。黑色短发，鬓角修短，皮肤偏小麦色，下巴有细微胡茬。身穿深色西装，白衬衫，系深色领带，西装剪裁合体，袖口平整，手指粗壮，戴一枚男士婚戒。整体气质强势现实。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;描述：新郎，沈念的未婚夫。他向林秀兰借款三十万并转给妹妹，隐瞒担保，婚宴上公开旧担保复印件逼迫沈念。他强势现实，仍要搬空老房，是冲突的核心人物。&#10;提示词：【画风·最高优先级】四格统一：超写实摄影风格，8K超清细节，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，RAW原片质感，超高清锐度，人物面部毛孔清晰可见&#10;MANDATORY ART STYLE (all 4 panels): photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo.&#10;&#10;Industrial character reference sheet — image only, no text reply.&#10;&#10;ONE image, single canvas (NOT a 2×2 or 4×4 grid, NOT four equal quadrants). Layout:&#10;- Top: thin light-gray technical TITLE BAR; title text must be legible (use the character name / title given in the user prompt body).&#10;- Main area FIXED SPLIT: LEFT ~1/3 COLUMN = FACE HERO CLOSE-UP (tall vertical hero face; maximize face scale, reduce empty margin).&#10;- RIGHT ~2/3 = labeled sub-panels: FRONT VIEW (front full body), BACK VIEW (back full body), SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP (90° profile face close-up, not full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, 