t full body), COSTUME / SUIT DETAIL VIEW, MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE NOTES (short tags only: cloth, metal, leather, edge wear — NOT a full-width bottom text bar). Optional SIGNATURE PROP / EQUIPMENT DETAIL if the user prompt mentions that prop.&#10;- NO left-profile full-body panel. FRONT and BACK: same character, same outfit, same proportions, same lighting and scale; neutral standing, head-to-toe, arms at sides, no action pose. SIDE PROFILE CLOSE-UP complements FACE HERO (same identity/age/makeup; profile view, not duplicate front face).&#10;- Costume/material only in right-side panels. No color-swatch strip. Fine light-gray dividers. Cinematic industrial reference sheet, 4K detail density — not a poster, not a comic grid, not a photo collage.&#10;&#10;Solid white only (RGB 255,255,255). No watermark logos. Panel titles and material tags printed ON the reference sheet are required. No environment/ground beyond minimal foot contact if needed. Follow ART STYLE / 画风 / MANDATORY ART STYLE at the start of the user message if present.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;女性，年龄约五十六七岁，体型偏瘦，背略佝偻。圆脸，颧骨微凸，眼角与嘴角有细纹，眉色浅淡，眼神疲惫躲闪，鼻翼较宽，嘴唇干薄。头发花白掺杂，短卷发梳理整齐，皮肤暗黄，有老年斑和真实皮肤纹理。身穿暗紫红色针织开衫，内搭深色衬衫，下穿黑色长裤，手拿旧式手袋，手指关节明显。整体气质操劳隐忍。超写实摄影风格，极高分辨率，精准自然光照，真实皮肤纹理，专业摄影机拍摄，原始底片质感，超高清锐度，面部毛孔清晰可见，画面比例十六比九。&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;GENDER: female only — feminine build and facial features; do not masculinize. Reiterate: same art style as above (photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo).</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">酒店大堂通往出口的通道，玻璃门外是午后街道，阳光从门外倾泻而入</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">午后，酒店大堂出口处自然光与室内冷光交汇</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">【镜头类型】远景&#10;【运镜】跟镜&#10;【动作】沈念提着裙摆跑向玻璃门，母亲在身后叫她，她没有回头。镜头跟拍她奔跑的背影，她推开玻璃门，午后阳光瞬间将她吞没。&#10;【对话】林秀兰（画外）：&quot;念念——&quot; 周维（画外）：&quot;门我开，今天一定搬空。&quot;&#10;【解说】&#10;【结果】沈念冲出玻璃门，阳光将她的白色婚纱照得刺眼。她站在街边，身后是母亲的呼喊和周维的语音，面前是午后空旷的街道。&#10;【情绪】决绝</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">林秀兰（画外）：&quot;念念——&quot; 周维（画外）：&quot;门我开，今天一定搬空。&quot;</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念提着裙摆跑向玻璃门，母亲在身后叫她，她没有回头。镜头跟拍她奔跑的背影，她推开玻璃门，午后阳光瞬间将她吞没。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念推门冲出酒店，继续向外奔去；镜头结束于她离开，不新增站在街边的停顿。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">玻璃门外午后阳光强烈，逆光将沈念轮廓镀上金边，室内冷光在身后渐远，氛围从压抑转向空旷而未知</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">酒店大堂通往出口的通道，玻璃门外是午后街道，阳光从门外倾泻而入，午后，酒店大堂出口处自然光与室内冷光交汇，远景·平视·正面，沈念提着裙摆跑向玻璃门，母亲在身后叫她，她没有回头。镜头跟拍她奔跑的背影，她推开玻璃门，午后阳光瞬间将她吞没，决绝，photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k uhd, sharp focus, natural lighting, real skin texture, hyperrealism, professional photography, RAW photo，首帧静止画面</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;">沈念提起裙摆跑向门口，母亲在身后叫她，她不回头。周维画外语音：门我开，今天一定搬空。结束于沈念推门冲出酒店继续行动，不停在街边。</td><td style="white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;mso-data-placement:same-cell;"></td></tr></tbody></table></body></html>